(126, 'Regency Plastering Ltd', 'c-linkpbrown@rvpl.co.uk', 'Regency Plastering Ltd', '01474 707255', '07970 270983', '3246540', 'rvpl.co.uk.jpg', 'Creating Inspirational Finishes Since 1996', 'www.rvpl.co.uk', '<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Regency Plastering Limited</strong><em> is a professional contractor b</em>ased in Kent specialising&nbsp;in insulated and&nbsp;through coloured <strong>renders</strong> and <strong>polished</strong> <strong>plaster</strong>.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">We are genuine experts in the field of&nbsp; Insulated and through coloured renders including Sto &amp; Aliva&nbsp;systems and polished plaster. We work with many contractors and on a variety of differing projects from commercial through to domestic. With a genuine commitment to high quality and completing projects to budget and on-time we have grown as a business from repeat business and word of mouth recommendations.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Please get in touch to see how we can be of assistance on your project.</p>', 1, 3, '2016-10-09 16:08:00', NULL, NULL, 5),
