(308, 'VM Interiors and Drywall Solutions LTD', 'c-linkinfo@vminteriors.co.uk', '16 Park crescent east Northampton NN5 7NT', '01604 969019', '01604 969019', '09699406', 'vm.logo_.png', 'Partitions, Suspended Ceilings, MF and Interior Solutions', 'www.vminteriors.co.uk', '<p>VM Interiors is a leading specialist with over 10 years of solid experience.</p>\r\n<p>We pride ourselves on our experience, delivering the highest standard of work that is both on time and within your budget. We can do everything, from wall lining to boarding, metal stud partitions, metal frames and more, making us one of the top choices in the industry. We have experience working on new builds, schools, offices, hospitals and even hotels, carrying out contracts from dry construction to partition walls and suspended ceilings with the utmost diligence and professionalism.</p>\r\n<p>Based in the West Midlands, VM Interiors has developed into a fast-growing organisation that specializes in interior and commercial fittings.</p>', 1, 3, '2018-02-11 17:35:03', NULL, NULL, 5),
