(400, 'ARS UK Limited', 'c-linkadrian.linton@arsltd.co.uk', 'Prout Industrial Estate, Point Rd, Canvey Island, Essex SS8 7TJ', '01268 511423', '01268 511423', '03348540', 'HomeBox-1.jpg', 'Architectural Refining Services_', 'www.arsltd.co.uk', '<p>ARS UK Ltd&nbsp;Limited is a London based Specialist building repair and refurbishment company established in 1992.</p><p>Since formation the company has grown from strength to strength and has a&nbsp;reputation as the genuine leader in the field of On Site Spraying. Our focus is on delivering the highest quality service to ensure our clients hand over projects with ease.</p><p>We work largely on Commercial and High End Residential buildings and such is our focus on Quality Assurance, that our clients can rely on our services on their flagship projects including:</p><ul><li>20 Fenchurch Street (The Walkie Talkie)</li><li>Canary Wharf Buildings</li><li>Wembley</li><li>Strata Building</li><li>The New American Embassy</li></ul><p>The company has grown in recent years and our services now extend to Glass Repairs, Cleaning and Restoration Works and also&nbsp;intumescent fire resistant coatings.</p><p>Contact the team today to see how we can be of assistance on your project.</p>', 1, 3, '2018-02-06 14:49:32', NULL, NULL, 5),
