(520, 'London Bespoke Glass Solutions', 'c-linklondonbespokeglasssolutions@gmail.com', '1&2 The Barn, Oldwick, West Stoke Road, Lavant, Chichester, West Sussex, PO18 9AA', '07985 772824', '07985 772824', '10004901', 'specialist-logo.png', 'Vision of the Future_', 'www.londonbespokeglasssolutions.com', '<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"color: #1c3e77;\">London Bespoke Glass Solutions Ltd is the surprise innovative independent UK glazing company. We offer a Complete Design, Management, and Installation Package and also offer a maintenance contract for all commercial &amp; residential applications. &nbsp;</span><br /><span style=\"color: #1c3e77;\"><br />Having gained the highest standard of knowledge from here in the UK and in Europe and recently in Canada the ideas and the availability of glass &amp; systems is endless. Due to our independent status we are able to offer a fantastic array of glazing products and solutions, using major brands such as Schott, Pilkington, Saint Gobain, AGC (Glaverbel), and Guardian Industries.</span><br /><span style=\"color: #1c3e77;\"><br />London Bespoke Glass Solutions Ltd always strives towards the highest quality product, workmanship, finish, and customer care. Utilizing the latest technology to provide outstanding quality at competitive rates.</span></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #1c3e77;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">We offer a wide range of products and services including commercial refurbishments, architectural and structural glazing. Get in touch to see how we can be of assistance on your project today.</span></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', 1, 3, '2018-02-15 22:52:37', NULL, NULL, 5),
