(1013, 'Refresh PSC', 'c-linkandy@refreshpsc.co.uk', '2F Hale Lane, London. NW7 3NX', '02089 596424', '07521 720178', '10804261', 'specialist-logo.png', 'Highest Rated in London', 'www.refreshpsc.co.uk', '<p><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">Refresh Property Services and Consultants are a small company specialising in basement waterproofing and we&nbsp;have over 25 year&rsquo;s experience in the Damp &amp; Timber Treatment and Cellar/Basement Conversion/Waterproofing Arena.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">We are&nbsp;arguably the highest rated company of our type in the UK and have will complete projects in London and across the Home Counties utilising all modern technologies, products and methods, including:</span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">Type A (Tanking)</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">Type B (Waterpoofing Concrete)</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">Type C (Cavity Drain Membrane)</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">We are certified and endorsed by all relevant trade bodies and suppliers as well as fully insured and able to offer insurance backed 10 year guarantees on all work.&nbsp;We pride ourselves on providing comprehensive well-presented surveys that will allow you to see what is wrong, how we propose to rectify your issues, and the cost involved.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">Please feel free to get in touch with Refresh PSC today to see how we can help on your next project.</span></p>', 1, 3, '2017-04-05 15:19:26', NULL, NULL, 5),
