(1072, 'Sollex Products Limited', 'c-linkmichelle@sollex.co.uk', 'Unit 1, Oliver Business Park, Oliver Road, LONDON, NW10 7JB', '02071 000900', '02071 000900', '7023291', 'Sollex-Logo.jpg', 'Windows made for life', 'www.sollex.co.uk', '<p>Sollex are a family run business based in North West London, specialising in Bespoke Timber Windows and External Doors. We work with both professional and domestic clients and cover the whole of London.</p>\r\n<p>Our main purpose is to manufacture, deliver, and install made to measure units according to each project specifications. We are a FENSA approved company, complying with the latest Building Regulations.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', 1, 3, '2017-10-04 14:39:53', NULL, NULL, 5),
