(1130, 'Walden and Fletcher Electrical Contractors', 'c-linkwaldenandfletcher@gmail.com', 'Unit 9 Space Business Centre, Quedgeley, Gloucester, GL2 4AL', '07713 447924', '07970 110854', '8349673', 'walden-and-fletcher-logo.png', 'Approved Electrical Contractors Serving the South, South Wales and The Midlands', 'www.waldenandfletcher.com', '<p><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\"><strong>Walden &amp; Fletcher Electrical Contractors LTD</strong> are an NICEIC Approved Contractor based in Gloucester but carry out works across the South, South West, South Wales and the Midlands. We are an established and experienced Electrical Contractor with over 35 years in the industry and carry accreditations from CHAS,SMAS,Construction line and Trust Mark. We pride ourselves on producing the highest standard of works and keeping our customer service at the forefront of our business.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">Walden &amp; Fletcher specialize in the full scope of Electrical Installation. These services range from large/small new build projects, high end restoration works and Fire Alarm &amp; Security systems. All of our operatives/supervisors carry up to date ECS Cards and have the relevant training to complete and manage works on any active sites.</span></p>', 1, 3, '2017-12-04 10:04:20', NULL, NULL, 5),
