(1145, 'Prime Technical Services Ltd', 'c-linkprimetechnicalservices@outlook.com', '69 Walsall Road, Little Aston, Sutton Coldfield, B75 3BA', '01215 374252', '07970 272608', '4422535', 'Network EPS.JPG', '', '', '<p>Prime Technical Services Ltd is a nationwide Specialist Contractor with expertise in Commercial, Domestic, and Industrial Mechanical and Electrical Installations. We operate across the UK from our Midlands hub and we provide high-quality electrical services for a range of schemes. We combine the latest skills and technology with traditional family values, to design, supply, and install systems to the highest standards.</p>\r\n<p>We welcome new clients and look forward to hearing from you.</p>', 1, 3, '2017-10-03 12:58:59', NULL, NULL, 5);
