(1595, 'Adrian@amoloneyconstruction.co.uk', 'c-linkAdrian@amoloneyconstruction.co.uk', '', '', '0', '6324607', 'specialist-logo.png', '', '', NULL, 1, 3, '2020-08-19 11:28:47', NULL, NULL, 5),
(1596, 'HEB Contractors Limited', 'c-linkinfo@hebcontractors.co.uk', '25 Longwater Road, Bracknell, United Kingdom, RG12 7NT', '01344 444929', '07444 249085', '9442788', 'heb-final.png', 'GROUNDWORK\'S & CIVIL ENGINEERING', 'www.hebcontractors.co.uk', '<p>HEB Contractors Limited was established in 2015, we provide a service that combines both Groundwork and RC Frame trades as one cost-effective package that ensures exceptional quality of work and an ability to meet programmes that would otherwise be difficult to achieve using two separate contractors.</p><p>We work with our clients at the early stages of design to ensure that all package requirements are taken account of within the design (we appoint external design consultants to prepare full Groundworks or RC Frame design drawings and calculation) so that a cost-effective Groundworks is employed for use by all trades to try and limit number of adaptions thereby saving time and costs.</p><p>We are a major player in facade works of Groundworks of buildings. We employ a good quality workforce with all our operatives holding the requisite CSCS CPCS CARDS</p><p>We have a long-established and good reputation within the industry, our Contracts Directors have over 17 years’ experience in all aspects of the construction industry from one of houses to large and complex high rise developments, our contracts managers hold a minimum SMSTS and all foreman a minimum SSSTS.</p><p>We are proud of the fact that we work as a team to construct a project as cost-effectively as possible, to programme and to a high-quality standard and of course with health and safety as the number one priority. We like to build a good working relationship with our client’s and work closely with them.</p><p>Our Construction Director is happy to attend meetings with the clients’ architects at design stage to make details simpler and cost-effective and offers value engineering advice, he is very ‘hands-on’ and visits each site at least weekly to ensure we are maintaining the highest level of service to our client’s.</p><p>We have our own independent Health and Safety Advisor who carries out monthly site inspections of each site and provides a comprehensive report of his findings so that any safety aspects can be addressed immediately and our high health and safety standards maintained, in addition, we appoint a separate Safety Advisor to carry out an annual audit of our systems, yard and sites to ensure these are of the highest standard.</p>', 1, 3, '2017-11-15 12:16:45', NULL, NULL, 5),
