(1664, 'Access Contractors UK Ltd', 'c-linkelena@access-contractors.co.uk', '9-23 High Street, Suite D, Pinner, United Kingdom, HA5 5PJ', '07783 913212', '07856 957471', '11035247', 'unnamed.jpg', 'Specialist Contractors serving London and the South East', 'www.access-contractors.co.uk', '<p id=\"h.p_b8C7SM8pe7EN\" class=\"zfr3Q\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: #212121; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 400; font-family: Lato, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6667; padding-top: 12px; text-align: justify;\">Access Contractors UK Limited is a highly successful and evolving business which has a proven track record of strategic delivery within the commercial marketplace.</p>\r\n<p class=\"zfr3Q\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: #212121; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 400; font-family: Lato, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6667; padding-top: 12px; text-align: justify;\">Access Contractors UK Limited has built an enviable track record of delivering prestigious top quality brickwork contracts including those which have been recognised with NHBS awards for high standards of workmanship. We have a dedicated team of craftsmen who form the backbone of the company and as part of our corporate policy, all workers enjoy the benefits of a bespoke training and development programe.</p>\r\n<p class=\"zfr3Q\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: #212121; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 400; font-family: Lato, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6667; padding-top: 12px; text-align: justify;\">Access Contractors UK Limited has expertise in Brick and Block work as well as scaffolding erection and we cover the following specialist trades:</p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li class=\"zfr3Q\" style=\"color: #212121; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 400; font-family: Lato, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6667; text-align: justify;\">Brickwork and Blockwork</li>\r\n<li class=\"zfr3Q\" style=\"color: #212121; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 400; font-family: Lato, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6667; text-align: justify;\">Carpentry</li>\r\n<li class=\"zfr3Q\" style=\"color: #212121; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 400; font-family: Lato, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6667; text-align: justify;\">Scaffolding</li>\r\n<li class=\"zfr3Q\" style=\"color: #212121; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 400; font-family: Lato, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6667; text-align: justify;\">Painting and Decorating</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p id=\"h.p_fpnskzlde7EV\" class=\"zfr3Q\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: #212121; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 400; font-family: Lato, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6667; padding-top: 12px; text-align: justify;\">Our achievements over the years, particularly in the areas of sustainability and employment culminated in prestigious achivements. All our staff is fully certified and trained for all the works they perform and we undertake continuous training and skills improvment of the staff.</p>\r\n<p id=\"h.p_e3e-g7Lve7Eh\" class=\"zfr3Q\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: #212121; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 400; font-family: Lato, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6667; padding-top: 12px; text-align: justify;\">The scale and flexibility of our multi-disciplinary workforce and broad experience allows us to deliver complex projects of all scope and size across a wide variety of built forms.</p>\r\n<p id=\"h.p_cQbQnASve7Eq\" class=\"zfr3Q\" style=\"margin: 0px; color: #212121; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 400; font-family: Lato, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6667; padding-top: 12px; padding-bottom: 0px; text-align: justify;\">We welcome new clients and look forward to hearing from you.</p>', 1, 3, '2018-01-29 13:14:34', NULL, NULL, 5),
