(1691, 'Archiclad (UK) Limited', 'c-linkgoksu@archiclad.org.uk', 'Archiclad (UK) Limited One Canada Square, Canary Wharf, London, UK. E14 5AA', '07958 174055', '07506 395073', '10164731', 'Archiclad Guncel (002).jpg', 'Are you ready to view the world from our frame?', 'www.archiclad.com', '<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 11.25pt; text-align: justify; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"color: #333333; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Archiclad (UK) Limited was founded in 2016 in London by Mimsa iAll legal duties have been fulfilled. First contract is made with Bouygues UK for Addlestone Town Centre project. </span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 11.25pt; text-align: justify; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"color: #333333; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Since January 2017 installation activities on site of this project has been ongoing actively by Archiclad Mimsa Aluminium was established in 1978 and is one of the prominent companies in the industry with over 35 years of industrial experience and aluminum applications which are suitable for any project ranging from large-scaled commercial structures to small-scaled private residences. </span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 11.25pt; text-align: justify; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"color: #333333; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Mimsa is a solution partner of Sch&uuml;co Turkey, the leading aluminium building solutions brand in Europe. Reinforced with the cutting-edge technologies, Mimsa&rsquo;s production points operate within the ISO 9001 quality assurance system. Mimsa, a devoted follower and applier of the industrial developments and innovations since its foundation, aims to meet the requests of the customers in a high quality, reliable, economical and timely fashion. </span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 11.25pt; text-align: justify; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"color: #333333; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">The production and installation phases of all projects carried out with the same professional approach. are executed by seasoned architects, engineers and other expert teams. Along with the numerous successful domestic projects, Mimsa has also gained recognition with its overseas operations. Mimsa Aluminium has focused its attention on overseas projects since 1986, and celebrated the opening of a new branch in Moscow, Russian Federation in 2003.</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 11.25pt; text-align: justify; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"color: #333333; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\"> Mimsa Aluminium has adopted the principle of working in compliance with legal provisions, international standards and agreements. Keeping in mind that we have borrowed the world from future generations, Mimsa executes every single project with respect to nature. Several new projects are being followed by Archiclad for future development.</span></span></p>', 1, 3, '2017-12-11 07:40:06', NULL, NULL, 5),
