(2235, 'Rosguill Developments Limited', 'c-linkfrank.mcbride@rosguilldev.com', 'Martindale House, 4 Stanley Road, Enfield, Middlesex, EN1 1NG', '02083 665535', '07967 350911', '03932679', 'rgdevss.PNG', 'South East Fit Out Contractors', 'www.rosguilldev.com', '<p class=\"myclass\" style=\"font-family: sofia_pro_softlight;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">Rosguill Developments Limited are experts in Fit-Out Works.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"myclass\" style=\"font-family: sofia_pro_softlight;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">Rosguill are a team of passionate, knowledgeable and dedicated professionals, who promise to provide a second to none service and assist you in achieving your exact requirements. We are committed to the creation of long term client relationships and understand the importance of commercial realities whilst delivering innovative construction to the highest standards in quality. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"myclass\" style=\"font-family: sofia_pro_softlight;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">Based in London, Rosguill is well positioned to offer a nationwide service that guarantees customer satisfaction on every project. Offering responsive, on time, quality performance, solutions and service at competitive costs while maintaining an exceptional safety record is a philosophy which has resulted in consistent business growth since its establishment in 1998.</span></p>', 1, 3, '2021-01-19 07:46:31', NULL, NULL, 5),
