(2621, 'Building Vision London LTD', 'c-linkoffice@buildingvisionlondon.co.uk', 'kt91rw', '02033 026361', '07871 64766', '09837798', 'BVL_final_logo.jpg', 'Keeping London Homes in Top condition', 'www.buildingvisionlondon.uk', '<p class=\"myclass\" style=\"font-family: sofia_pro_softlight;\">We provide an exceptional level of property maintenance and building services to homes and commercial buildings across South West London. Even your dream home will need some maintenance from time-to-time, whether it&rsquo;s through choice such as building an extension, or in an emergency such as a burst pipe or a broken boiler.<br />At Building Vision (based in Putney, South West London) we pride ourselves on selecting the right builders,&nbsp;<a title=\"painters and decorators\" href=\"https://www.buildingvisionlondon.uk/decorators/\" rel=\"\">painters and decorators</a>,&nbsp;<a title=\"electricians in London\" href=\"https://www.buildingvisionlondon.uk/london-electricians/\" rel=\"\">electricians</a>, or even a&nbsp;<a title=\"handyman\" href=\"https://www.buildingvisionlondon.uk/handyman/\" rel=\"\">handyman</a>&nbsp;so that any property maintenance that you need will be completed quickly, efficiently and to a high standard.</p>', 1, 3, '2021-01-19 07:46:39', NULL, NULL, 5),
