(2672, 'Enviromech Ltd', 'c-linkshane@enviromech.co.uk', '71 - 75 Shelton Street, Covent Garden, WC2H 9JQ', '02039 055512', '07983 670349', '10129701', 'enviro.PNG', 'WE SET THE STANDARD IN MECHANICAL & ELECTRICAL DESIGN AND INSTALLATION', 'www.enviromech.co.uk', '<p class=\"myclass\" style=\"font-family: sofia_pro_softlight;\">Enviromech are a young dynamic building services companys specialising in design, installation and facility management services to our clients.</p>\r\n<p class=\"myclass\" style=\"font-family: sofia_pro_softlight;\">We provide Mechanical, Electrical, Renewable Energy and Air Conditioning &amp; Refrigeration services to all our clients across the industrial, commercial and retails sectors in the greater London area for over 10 years. &nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"myclass\" style=\"font-family: sofia_pro_softlight;\">Our aim is for 100% client satisfaction. Enviromech strives to be the contractor of choice with our client associates. We do this by providing dependable products and exceptional service in a value driven cost effective way by applying our expertise and understanding in everything we do.</p>', 1, 3, '2021-01-19 07:46:40', NULL, NULL, 5),
(2673, 'Copperstone Projects Ltd.', 'c-linkinfo@copperstone.uk', 'Tintagel House, 92 Albert Embankment, Vauxhall, London, SE1 7TT', '0207 725 1332', '', '11363481', 'oie_1916313pH4AUmtC.png', NULL, 'www.copperstone.uk', 'Copperstone Projects work as a Building and Refurbishment Contractor in Central London and Surrey.  Copperstone have experience over a wide range of disciplines including New Build, Fit Out, Refurbishment, Restoration and Block Maintenance.\nCopperstone’s focus is building long term relationships with Clients, delivering high quality projects on time, on budget and in a safe environment.\nCopperstone have experience of Design and Build, traditional procurement, Contractors Design working NEC and JCT contracts, as Principal Contractor and Designer if required.\nThe success of any project relies on detailed planning, effective procurement and clear communication between everybody ‘from the ground up’.\nAt Copperstone we are constantly working with our partners to limit risk and our success as a Contractor comes through our response to the challenges, which will inevitably arise in every Project.\nUnderpinning Copperstone’s progress is our diverse and well qualified supply chain and the ‘can do’ attitude of our preferred Sub-contractors.\nWe have experience in different sectors of Construction, but our ethos and enthusiasm remain the same with everything we do.\nTransparency and collaboration are at the heart of what we do and our aim is to build on the relationships we have with clients and their professional teams, for life, to work hard and continually improve both our business and our clients projects.', 1, 2, '2019-06-06 11:48:21', NULL, NULL, 5),
