(2701, 'H.A. Marks Construction Limited', 'c-linkinfo@hamarks.com', 'Corrib House, 1 Beadman Street, London, SE27 0DN', '02086596918', '', '00697561', 'H.A Marks.png', NULL, 'www.hamarks.co.uk', 'H.A. Marks is an award winning family owned construction services company that has been trading continually for more than 70 years.\nDuring this time we have been at the leading edge of construction, developing creative innovative and sustainable solutions to meet client’s needs.\nWe have successfully extended our services across the country via our project delivery teams, created job opportunities and skill development in local communities where we deliver projects.\nWe have a strong reputation for understanding and delivering projects, utilising sustainable technology systems within the buildings fabric.\nA One-Stop Solution H A Marks has grown and gained a reputation as a principal contractor serving London and the South East. Our philosophy has been to build upon those areas of expertise that have made the company successful.\nOur accreditations are a true measure of the processes and management structure required to undertake your project, proving that we not only have the systems and services required but that we deliver time and time again.\nWe are proud that repeat business represents a substantial proportion of our turnover due to the confidence and relationships that we have built with our clients.\nWe operate from our 14,000 square feet Head Office/Yard facility in South London. The company has grown steadily in the last 10 years to offer in-house specialist services to our clients.\nWe offer clients a one stop solution in that we manage and build the project from start through to completion. We highly value our staff and management team who have the wealth of experienced required to deliver our projects to the highest standard.\nBest Practice is perpetuated through our In-House CPD, CIOB and CITB training and apprenticeship programs developed over the years.\nAs a CIOB Chartered Building Company our core business is the Role of Principal Contractor working for;\nLocal Authorities,  Train Operating Companies, Overground & Underground, Churches, Commercial clients and Architectural practices. \nWe are ISO 45001, 14001 and 9001 audited and approved. We fully embrace these standards into our activities and this is reflected in our output.', 1, 2, '2019-07-08 08:40:39', NULL, NULL, 5),
