(2705, 'TFL Scaffolding Limited', 'c-linkoffice@tflscaffolding.com', 'Unit 8, 349C High Road, Wood Green, London', '02088 814570', '07834 076617', '8186791', 'logo-blue (1).jpeg', 'Support at the Highest Levels', 'www.tflscaffolding.com', '<p class=\"font_7\">TFL is a commercial scaffolding company&nbsp;offering bespoke scaffolding solutions to clients large or small who demand work of the highest calibre.</p>\r\n<p class=\"font_7\">We are trusted to work on London&rsquo;s landmark buildings and prestige projects from Crossrail to historical sites such as Buckingham Palace, BBC Television Centre, Selfridges, Claridges, Battersea Power Station, Wembley Stadium and Admiralty Arch amongst many others.</p>\r\n<p class=\"font_7\">With our in-depth knowledge, expertise and proactive approach to problem-solving, we are able to provide solutions that satisfy our clients` requirements.</p>\r\n<p class=\"font_7\">We pride ourselves on reliability, high standards, commitment, and our ability to deliver complex and diverse projects.</p>', 1, 3, '2021-01-19 07:46:41', NULL, NULL, 5),
