(2941, 'Nationwide Green Roofs', 'c-linknationwide-green-roof@c-link.com', 'BUILDING 5, LONDON AVENUE, LONDON, NW12', '01234 567890', '01234 567890', '012345678', 'download.png', 'Supreme Green Roofing', 'http://www.nationwide.com', '<p>We are your premier roofing company serving the Southeast of England and London. Our services include Single Ply Roofing, Flat Roofing, and Green Roofing. With a focus on sustainability and top-notch craftsmanship, we provide reliable and eco-friendly roofing solutions for residential and commercial properties. Experience the excellence of Nationwide Green Roofs today!</p>', 1, 3, '2021-01-19 07:46:51', NULL, NULL, 5),
