(3148, 'BBS plumbing and heating', 'c-linkbernard@bbsplumbandheat.com', '', '', '0', ' OC343675', 'specialist-logo.png', '', '', NULL, 1, 3, '2021-01-19 07:46:58', NULL, NULL, 5),
(3164, 'ATEC M&E', 'c-linktenders@atecme.co.uk', '7 Flint Rd, Letchworth Garden City SG6 1HJ', '01462 374024', '07824 701131', '12362336', 'logo_high_resolution.png', 'Electrical Contractors, Plumbing &amp; Heating Professionals, Fire &amp; Security Experts', 'www.atecme.co.uk', '<p>We understand the importance of reliable and responsible maintenance to ensure the efficient running of offices, warehouses, and accommodation, so train all of our professionals to be multi-disciplined and knowledgeable in the following areas.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Electrical</strong></p>\r\n<p>We support your commercial, domestic or industrial property with efficient electrical installations and general electrical maintenance. We are able to provide a 24/7 emergency call out service to ensure when an electrical disaster strikes your company, you suffer as little down time as possible.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Plumbing &amp; Heating Services</strong></p>\r\n<div class=\"col-md-8\">We are fully qualified to provide assistance with any domestic or commercial plumbing incident as well as providing Gas Safe checks and Landlord Certifications. We are also readily available to provide emergency boiler repairs and services, and can offer central heating installations.</div>\r\n<div class=\"col-md-8\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"col-md-8\"><strong>Our Accreditations</strong></div>\r\n<div class=\"col-md-8\">\r\n<p>We are accredited by industry-leading organisations to ensure our service remains the highest standard possible. We are regularly assessed and vetted by these organisations to approve our methods or working and to provide you with confidence that our technicians know the safest and most thorough solutions for your requirements.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"col-md-8\">&nbsp;</div>', 1, 3, '2021-01-19 07:46:59', NULL, NULL, 5),
