(3256, 'RJ Drylining Limited', 'c-linkryan@rjdrylining.co.uk', 'unit 17 Dunsteads farm, trueloves lane, Ingatestone, Essex CM40NJ', '01245 701090', '07867 384125', '9407570', 'RJ Drylining logo thumb.jpg', 'Delivering on Time, Every time.', 'www.rjdrylining.co.uk', '<p>Chelmsford based RJ Drylining is a growing contractor we specialise in suspended ceilings, drylining and all wall finishes. We are a Chas registered company with full health and safety policy. We are looking to increase our turnover in the coming months/years and can offer some competitive tenders. All our operatives have CSCS cards and we have carried out some high profile works throughout the United Kingdom, including Ireland.</p>\r\n<p>The logistics and management of labour and fast problem solving are paramount to doing a job efficiently. If there are issues onsite, and changes occur, we respond to instructions as quickly as possible, informing you of costs so you know where you stand.</p>\r\n<p>Our philosophy is to consistently offer a first-class service which includes effective time management of all projects and maintaining a high standard of workmanship.</p>', 1, 3, '2021-01-19 07:47:02', NULL, NULL, 5),
(3263, 'Trio Maintenance Ltd', 'c-linksolutions@trio-thedifference.com', 'Penhurst House, 352 - 356 Battersea Park Road', '02079 938978', '07534 115760', '11111904', 'Capture.PNG', 'Trio The Difference', 'www.trio-thedifference.com', '<p class=\"myclass\" style=\"font-family: sofia_pro_softlight;\">Trio has three divisions to the company.</p>\r\n<p class=\"myclass\" style=\"font-family: sofia_pro_softlight;\">Property Maintenance</p>\r\n<p class=\"myclass\" style=\"font-family: sofia_pro_softlight;\">Property Construction</p>\r\n<p class=\"myclass\" style=\"font-family: sofia_pro_softlight;\">Property Development</p>\r\n<p class=\"myclass\" style=\"font-family: sofia_pro_softlight;\">Having occupied the Property Maintenance industry by storm and working with London\'s most respected Property Management companies, Hotels, Co - ops and single landlords for the last 7 years, we have seen huge pitfall in this industry and the main one is lack of technology. Trio promote transparency, fairness and we are always looking for new ways to make the industry better and more efficient.</p>\r\n<p class=\"myclass\" style=\"font-family: sofia_pro_softlight;\">It suddenly took off very quickly into construction, from single extenstions, refurbs to now new builds. Trio are now also developing our own units, using modern methods of construction, in this space, we promote ourselves as being \"Cheaper, Faster and Better\". Contact us to find our more how we can speed up your next development and cheaper build while mainting the quality.</p>\r\n<p class=\"myclass\" style=\"font-family: sofia_pro_softlight;\">We express who we truly are in the business space, fair, innovative and love building new relationships.</p>\r\n<p class=\"myclass\" style=\"font-family: sofia_pro_softlight;\">We look forward to working in this platform and build stronger relationships with it\'s users and hopefully, healthy business and healthy relationships for years to come.</p>\r\n<p class=\"myclass\" style=\"font-family: sofia_pro_softlight;\">Trio, Experience the Difference.</p>', 1, 3, '2021-01-19 07:47:03', NULL, NULL, 5),
