(3291, 'GPS Waterproofing Ltd', 'c-linkjon@gpswaterproofing.co.uk', '14 Tewkesbury Road, Elstow', '07545 838120', '07545 838120', '10256507', 'GPS.JPG', 'Excellence as standard', 'www.gpswaterproofing.co.uk', '<p class=\"double-col\">GPS Waterproofing Ltd is a newly established company within the roofing industry, but have over 30 years of experience through the personnel behind this new venture. We would like to take this opportunity to introduce ourselves and list the various roofing products which can be carried out by our experienced and fully trained operatives. Over many years the management team have carried out or have been part of a team, that have installed thousands of metres of various products to date, within the flat roofing industry.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Felt Systems</li>\r\n<li>Liquid Systems</li>\r\n<li>Asphalt Systems</li>\r\n<li>Hot/Cold Melt Systems</li>\r\n<li>Inverted Roof Systems</li>\r\n<li>Green Roof Systems</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p class=\"myclass\" style=\"font-family: sofia_pro_softlight;\">We also compliment these with our knowledge of Pitch roofing and all metal roofing combined. We pride ourselves with regards to client co-operation and the end product to be of a very high standard. We would like to take this opportunity to offer our services and to establish a working partnership for the future.</p>', 1, 3, '2021-01-19 07:47:04', NULL, NULL, 5),
