(3720, 'Mason\'s Pride Limited', 'c-linkdg@masonspride.com', '1 Lenor Close, Bexleyheath, England, DA6 8NH', '07877 451587', '07877 451587', '12269876', 'Masons Pride Logp.jpg', 'Mason\'s Pride Limited', 'www.masonspride.com', '<p>We are a multi-disciplined subcontractor operating in London and the South East. We can provide full labour, plant, and materials service but are also happy to work on a labour-only basis.</p><p>We are well suited for project packages between £100,000 - £500,000 and our specialisms include:</p><ul><li>Carpentry 1st &amp; 2nd Fix</li></ul><p>Please get in touch with us if you have any of the requirements above - we\'d love to hear from you.</p>', 1, 3, '2021-01-19 07:47:23', NULL, NULL, 5),
