(3928, 'F&C Developments Ltd', 'c-linkfrgondal@gmail.com', '71-75 Shelton Street, Covent Garden, London, WC2H 9JQ', '02030265961', '', '11475240', 'oie_1516157l8WPoCqX.jpg', NULL, 'www.fxcd.co.uk', 'We are an ambitious design and sustainability-led property developer,\nleveraging over a decade of experience. We champion architecture and\ninnovation, striving to build spaces that enhance people’s lives. We’re on a\nmission to prove that combining sustainability, design and social value,\ncan achieve outsized economic returns.', 0, 2, '2020-12-22 21:02:26', NULL, NULL, 5),
