(3944, 'Lilstone Limited', 'c-linkadamwhitehouse@lilstone.co.uk', 'Mitre House, 66 Abbey Road, Enfield, EN1 2QN', '02083 644812', '02083 644812', '03437484', 'Lilstone Logo File.png', 'Building and Restoration Contractors', 'www.lilstone.co.uk', '<p>Lilstone&rsquo;s are a specialist restoration and refurbishment contractor proving services across a wide range of construction sectors, including new build, high-end residential, external fa&ccedil;ade restoration and internal refurbishments.</p>\r\n<p>Our multi-disciplinary workforce is highly experienced in building and maintaining premium properties, having worked with us over many years on public, private and commercial projects across London and the surrounding area.</p>\r\n<p class=\\\"myclass\\\" style=\\\"font-family: sofia_pro_softlight;\\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\\\"myclass\\\" style=\\\"font-family: sofia_pro_softlight;\\\">&nbsp;</p>', 1, 3, '2021-01-19 07:47:34', NULL, NULL, 5),
