(7319, 'Macar Bespoke (SA) Ltd', 'c-linkenquiries@macardevelopments.com', 'City House, Sutton Park Road, Sutton, England, SM1 2AE', '020 7145 4545', '', '14873929', 'Macar-Bespoke-Logo-No-BG - c-link resize.png', NULL, 'www.macardevelopments.com', 'To exceed the expectations of our customers by providing an unrivalled level of luxury in the homes that we build and a level of service that goes beyond what they thought possible.\nTo innovate, design and build ethically sustainable homes that integrate into and enrich the local community. We strive to provide a level of quality that enhances the lives and well-being of our customers.\nWe think when you buy a home you should be able to just get on and enjoy what is one of the most exciting experiences of your life, without any worries or stress. So, we design homes that aren’t just sustainable and ethical, but we go to great lengths to consider the local surroundings and community. So much so, we think you will be welcomed with open arms! We think about you and your family, your living experience and go beyond what you expect.\nIt is important that you buy a home where no corners are cut. We build to the highest standards, with excellence and quality running through in everything we do. This unparalleled attention to detail is culturally part of our nature. This will also be evident throughout your interactions with us, through one of our dedicated customer service team that believe in going that extra mile. In fact, this is so important, we back this up with our customer service charter.', 1, 2, '2021-01-25 17:04:12', NULL, NULL, 5),
(9363, 'JM Sealant Contracts Ltd', 'c-linkenquiries@jmgroupcontracts.co.uk', '57 Southend Rd, Grays RM17 5NL', '01375392225', '01375392225', '13134051', 'Company Logo.jpg', NULL, '', NULL, 1, 3, '2021-01-25 12:50:11', NULL, NULL, 5),
(9367, 'houseUP Limited', 'c-linkvinz@houseup.co.uk', '71-75 Shelton Street, London, WC2H 9JG', '0800 999 3229', '', '10160709', 'unnamed.jpg', NULL, 'www.houseup.co.uk', 'The idea of houseUP came when its founders experienced a renovation project for their own home, with a side of a rogue builder and a greedy freeholder.\nAfter solving all the issues and so many lessons learned, it was impossible to resist the pull of going out there to make a difference in construction services.\nToday houseUP renovates and builds beautiful homes, using digital platforms, agile processes and lean start-up framework, and working with the best tradespeople and suppliers on the market.\nSo that you can have what we couldn’t have as customers: making your dream home come true while having a great time on the journey.', 0, 2, '2021-01-26 12:01:04', NULL, NULL, 6),
