(9389, 'Absolute Workspace Limited', 'c-linkinfo@absoluteworkspace.co.uk', '1st Floor, 40 James Street, London, W1U 1EU', '07901 355 465', '', '06995515', 'oie_24161642RoXqA8Ym.jpg', NULL, 'www.absoluteworkspace.co.uk', 'Let Us Take Away The Stress Of Your Project.\nWith over 100 years of experience between our senior directors, we deliver exceptional workplaces for blue-chip clients across London and the South East.\nAs a main contractor, our clients include building surveyors, architects and commercial property agents as well as property owners, developers and investors. We specialise in office refurbishments, Cat A and Cat B works, common parts, receptions, PPM and dilapidations.\nThe common thread through every project is our experienced team. With our refurbishment expertise, we’ll provide you with excellent advice from day one and the capability to deliver your project on time and on budget.', 1, 2, '2021-02-24 15:10:17', NULL, NULL, 5),
