(9403, 'CMT Design & Construction Limited', 'c-linkinfo@cmtconstruction.co.uk', '4 Bedlam Mews, London, SE11 6DF', '020 7840 0186', '', '07381063', 'cmt-logo.png', NULL, 'www.cmtconstruction.co.uk', 'CMT Construction was founded in 2010, with the roots of the business going back four generations. The history of CMT Construction is one of dedication mixed with passion and ambition.\nConstruction has been the family trade spanning back four generations. The tradition began by the parents passing down their expertise and training to their sons and daughters into the family business, starting out their journey as apprentices and growing up as part of the construction industry.\nCMT Construction, as part of their history, have had the privilege to complete some major construction projects often for leading developers and end users, and in addition to this the current management team have a wide and impressive range of projects that they have been responsible for across many sectors.\nCMT Construction’s recent success has relied on our ability to evolve with the market, adopting the skills and techniques required to deliver on-time, to specification and budget without compromising quality. Developing and using new construction techniques, partnering with key suppliers, and working with off-site fabricators has added to our success. It has also made us able to maintain long term strong relationships with our oldest clients.', 0, 2, '2021-03-29 10:44:56', NULL, NULL, 5),
(9404, 'INSTRUMENT & CONTROL SERVICES LIMITED', 'c-linkgeorgina.hancox@icsluk.com', NULL, '07870585764', '0', '01464404', 'ICS Logo.jpg', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, 3, '2021-03-30 10:44:47', NULL, NULL, 5),
(9405, 'Fushi Investment Management Limited', 'c-linkshuo.zhao@fushigroup.com', 'Fushi Family Office, 26 Finsbury Square, London, EC2A 1DS', '0208 616 2204', '', '08184840', 'ezgif.com-gif-maker (1).jpg', NULL, 'www.fushigroup.com', NULL, 0, 2, '2021-04-12 10:21:36', NULL, NULL, 5),
(9406, 'Ernest Park Limited', 'c-linkinfo@ernestpark.com', 'EP Hub, Unit 1, Leavesden Lodge, 1A Leavesden Road, Watford, WD24 5FR', '020 3637 1296', '', '08624384', 'oie_2018337NIfAUmQW.png', NULL, 'www.ernestpark.com', 'A culture of honesty, openness and transparency underpins every area of our business.\nErnest Park helps our customers deliver projects of significant meaning and importance to their needs, and we know no two are the same. We want to help create an enduring positive legacy, promote communities and economies, improve society and contribute to it in a safe and sustainable manner. Our expertise in delivery and the ethos of partnership we bring to it has afforded us significant success that we share with our customers. We operate a round table approach, aligning everything we do to our customers’ goals.\nApproaching every project as an opportunity to demonstrate a commitment to deliver a high quality service.\nOur methods are guided by the best outcome for a project, with an absolute commitment of all our internal resources to achieve this. We break down barriers, build relationships and want to bring everyone along on the same positive, rewarding and coherent journey.', 1, 2, '2021-04-20 13:45:21', NULL, NULL, 6),
(9407, 'Ernest Park Ltd', 'c-linkcmcgivern@ernestpark.com', NULL, '07734466582', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, 2, '2021-04-21 15:11:10', NULL, NULL, 5),
(9409, 'Mera Real Estate Ltd', 'c-links.jain@merarealestate.co.uk', '25 High Street, Aldershot, Hampshire, GU11 1BP', '01252 204000', '', '11652889', 'oie_714419VZ9KA17V.png', NULL, 'www.merarealestate.co.uk', 'INTEGRITY, PASSION AND PERFORMANCE ARE THE THREE PILLARS OF OUR ORGANISATION\nWe, at Mera Real Estate Limited, have carved out a reputation for our attention to the minutiae of detail and our passion for creating homes that offer exceptional living experiences to every prospective home-buyer. Buying a home can be the single largest financial investment for many people. Our team fully understands this and hence, every decision we make during the property development process is taken with the hope of creating a perfectly tailored home for every unique home-buyer.\nOur team shares an unwavering passion for creating bespoke homes where quality has, is and will always remain at the forefront. Innovation is at the heart of our designing process. The property development industry is constantly evolving; we embrace this change and are driven to produce sustainable functional homes.\nAt Mera Real Estate Limited, integrity and honesty are at the core of every strategy and decision-making. This has helped us to form lasting relationships with all our stakeholders and contribute positively to our local community.\nWe as a company believe in having full control over the property development cycle, right from site acquisition, exemplary planning and designing, to building homes of the highest quality. Owing to this in-house team of experts, during all the stages of the development cycle, we have been successful in building homes we are truly proud of.\n“We believe that only by challenging conformity, can we deliver an end product that truly meets the evolving needs and desires of home-buyers.”', 1, 2, '2021-05-07 11:37:24', NULL, NULL, 5),
