(16154, 'AS MECHANICAL AND ELECTRICAL LTD', 'c-linkandy@asmeltd.com', 'Bournemouth,  United Kingdom,  28 Hannington Road,  BH7 6JT', '01202 416929', '07525 729447', '10724793', NULL, 'THE ULTIMATE PLANNED AND REACTIVE SERVICE PROVIDER IN THE SOUTH', 'www.asmeltd.com', '<p>AS plumbing have become closely associated with large scale heating, ventilation and plumbing projects throughout southern England.</p>\r\n<p>With a vast array of knowledge spanning over 10 years, our experienced design plumbing &amp; heating engineers comprehend and design the most complex heating, mechanical / electrical projects contained within large scale projects.</p>\r\n<p>This includes heating using Gas, Electric or Biomass central boiler plants, specific heating solutions for blocks of flats combining dry risers, sprinkler systems, supply and extract ventilation or individual gas or electric boiler systems within each property.</p>\r\n<p>As technology develops, we go the extra mile to make sure our technical engineers keep abreast of all new heating and plumbing technologies such as controlling the heating system centrally from a Smart phone or PC, electronic TRV&rsquo;s, smart radiators, weather compensators and devices to redirect free PV energy to an immersion heater or battery pack.</p>\r\n<p>Our comprehensive, energy efficient, heating &amp; ventilation solutions not only include property heating systems. As part of our consultancy and design package we also fully design and fit all internal pipe networks and drainage for new properties to guarantee utilities for kitchens, toilets and bathrooms match our high standards of plumbing maintaining consistency throughout each property and your development.</p>', 1, 4, '2021-05-14 13:46:00', '{\"2673\":{\"name\":\"Crystal Glass, Hendon\",\"email\":\"info@crystalunits.com\",\"address\":\"100 W Hendon Broadway, London NW9 7AA\",\"mobile\":\"\",\"type_id\":4,\"user\":{\"email\":\"info@crystalunits.com\",\"firstname\":\"Estimating Department\",\"display_name\":\"Estimating Department\",\"lastname\":\"\",\"password\":1620999960,\"type_id\":5,\"account_id\":16154}}}', NULL, 5),
