(16232, 'T K INSTALLATIONS LIMITED', 'c-linkmatt@tkinstallations.co.uk', 'England,  BN3 7ET,  Hove,  English Close,  10 English Business Park', '01273 692100', '07966877553', '03462012', NULL, 'Excellence engineered into every project', 'www.tkinstallations.co.uk', '<div>T.K. Installations was established in 1984 and has traded continuously throughout the ensuing years.</div>\r\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div>Operating throughout the United Kingdom for various Clients (Architects, Consulting Engineers and Main Contractors), we provide superior experience in all aspects of M&amp;E services.</div>\r\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div>Our aim is to provide an excellent service, second to none, at a competitive cost. We ensure that quality and finishes are maintained and not compromised.</div>\r\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>As experienced electrical engineers and contractors, we provide an extensive range of electrical services to architects, designers, consulting engineers, building surveyors and project management companies and organisations across the domestic, commercial and industrial sectors.</div>\r\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div>We are able to manage every aspect of a project including its design, installation, testing, commissioning and handover, together with future preventative and reactive maintenance.</div>\r\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div>Our team are fully conversant with current regulations and new technologies, and our designs and installations are executed to the highest quality.</div>\r\n</div>', 1, 3, '2021-05-14 13:46:25', '{\"name\":\"TK Installations\",\"email\":\"matt@tkinstallations.co.uk\",\"address\":\"\",\"mobile\":\"\",\"type_id\":3,\"user\":{\"email\":\"matt@tkinstallations.co.uk\",\"firstname\":\"Matthew\",\"display_name\":\"Matt Tiplady\",\"lastname\":\"Tiplady\",\"password\":1620999985,\"type_id\":5,\"account_id\":16232}}', '7025902354', 5),
