(17696, 'Boom Construction Limited', 'c-linkinfo@boomconstruction.co.uk', 'Rose Farm, Chiswell Green Lane, St Albans, AL2 3NR', '01442 767760', '', '07989022', 'oie_18141227G10WDaUq.png', NULL, 'www.boomconstruction.co.uk', 'Boom Construction, established in 2012, is a specialist contractor operating in London and the South East. We pride ourselves on our innovative project solutions and pro-active approach to building and maintaining long lasting relationships. \nWith extensive expertise gained delivering schemes within the residential, commercial, health and education sectors, our diverse range of capabilities allows us to provide our clients with effective solutions that consistently impress.\nAs a business we have evolved and grown rapidly since it\'s formation and are continuing to do so.  Our user-friendly approach has allowed us to form a solid base of clients, employees and suppliers and ensures that the needs of our clients are our top priority.\nThis client centered approach has led to a wide base of repeat work with clients who are continually impressed with our ability to deliver high quality products on time and within budget.', 1, 2, '2021-09-06 07:12:22', NULL, NULL, 5),
