(17760, 'Telphia and Telphia-Jones Investments Limited', 'c-linkroger.telphia@futurehsc.co.uk', '198 Lordswood Road, Birmingham, England, B17 8QH', '07710 416846', '', '09008663', 'oie_194237TvO3HDCG.jpg', NULL, 'www.futurehsc.com', 'Since 1996 Future has been responding to the needs of vulnerable people across Birmingham.\nWhen the community needs change, we change too. Being flexible and dynamic has enabled us to respond to new challenges and to continue to support people we care about regardless of turbulent times and changes in funding patterns.\nWe always put people first and that includes the people who use our services, their carers and families, our staff, and our many partners.\nOver the years we have supported clients and service users with a wide range of needs including mental health issues, learning difficulties, physical disabilities, and ex-offenders.\n\nOur main services are:\n\nCommunity Supported Living/Crisis House Services – Supported Living Care for people in mental health crisis offered in one of our three crisis homes across Birmingham. We work in conjunction with Birmingham and Solihull Mental Health Foundation Trust (specifically with adults) and with Forward Thinking Birmingham (with a special focus on young people through their specialised Early Intervention Service).\n\nSupported Accommodation – We offer homes for rent to vulnerable people across Birmingham and areas such as Gloucestershire, Derby and Leicester coupled with appropriate levels of support by our Housing Officers and specialised Housing Maintenance support. Our current housing stock consists of over 200 properties.\n\nFuture Care and Support Services – We provide practical, personal and social support to vulnerable people in their own homes.', 1, 2, '2021-09-28 12:53:38', NULL, NULL, 5),
(17761, 'HGG Construction Inc.', 'c-linkhuseyinguntas@hggconstruction.co.uk', 'The Old Rectory, 29 Martin Ln, London EC4R 0DJ, UK', '07765683217', '', '08422358', 'hgg_logo_en.png', NULL, 'www.hgg.com.tr', 'Since Our Establishment, We Have Decisively Continued To Improve Our Company Believing In Change And Development.\nFounded by Hüseyin Guntas in 1962 as Guntas Construction, our company was restructured in 1994 under the name of HGG Construction Industry and Trade Limited. The Company has been formed as HGG Construction Inc. since the beginning of 2016. Supported by its experience of more than 50 years and vision focused on the future, HGG has been delivering general contracting services in various fields of infrastructure sector.\nHGG uses its extensive knowledge not only for services provided or project liabilities committed, but also for the social responsibility and sustainable development, considering them as a corporate duty. HGG commits to the preventative resolution of potential problems while assuring problem-free and sound business processes throughout the project duration.', 0, 2, '2021-09-29 08:44:22', NULL, NULL, 5),
