(17790, 'MCR Property Group (MCR Management Limited)', 'c-linkenquiries@mcrproperty.com', 'Third Floor, Building 2, Universal Square, Devonshire St N, Manchester M12 6JH', '0203 598 5103', '', '5823622', 'oie_13105319HHSor35G.jpg', NULL, 'www.mcrproperty.com', 'MCR Property Group is a real estate investment and development company focused on the strategic acquisition and repositioning of commercial, residential, industrial and retail assets across the UK. \nThe company currently retains many options to a wide range of capital sources, through both equity and debt based finance. With strong ties to notable equity houses, MCR continually welcomes the opportunity for further collaborative partnerships, to allow the business to focus on what we do best; develop and add value across all property classes.\nWe are market leaders in acquisitions and complex ventures. We undertake the UK and international deals, many of which are transacted over complex and highly structured processes.\nWith a current pipeline that allows us to buy and sell an asset a week, our aspirations for further growth continues, focusing on the successfully delivery of assets in the market. We work well in both traditional and innovative property sectors, and are flexible in our approach, allowing us to quickly respond to shifts in demand and the wider market.\nThrough well-established relationships with a broad spectrum of private and institutional investors that include leading property sponsors, traditional and non-traditional lenders, capital market sources investment banks and brokerage firms, we are able to provide our clients and investors with superior returns and unsurpassed assistance in the acquisition of property.', 0, 2, '2021-10-13 18:48:47', NULL, NULL, 5),
