(17807, 'TRACK & BUILD LIMITED', 'c-linknicka@trackandbuild.co.uk', 'Wickford,  England,  SS11 8YB,  Unit 5 Hurricane Way,  Essex', '02074 764707', '07540 689949', '07719498', NULL, 'Track & Build is a business dedicated to the delivery of programmes within time and budge, within the UK\'s infrastructures.', 'www.trackandbuild.co.uk', '<p class=\"font_8\">At Track &amp; Build our success is not measured by the number of active projects on which we are engaged, nor the number of resources we have deployed at any given time. We measure success by the amount of repeat business we do and the longevity of our relationships.</p>\r\n<p class=\"font_8\">Like most successful companies we are selective about the relationships in which we engage and would be more inclined to work closely with a fewer number of clients. We recognise that in order to add \"true value\" it is essential to develop a detailed knowledge of our customer\'s requirements and expectations.</p>', 1, 3, '2021-10-28 19:31:17', NULL, NULL, 5),
