(17864, 'SHARP TECHNICAL LTD', 'c-linkmark@sharp-technical.co.uk', 'Unit 3 Union Close,  Tamworth,  England,  B77 1BB,  Staffordshire', '01827 426201', '07876 351654', '09851483', NULL, 'Sharp Technical Ltd the electrical, structured cabling and home automation specialists.', 'www.sharp-technical.co.uk', '<div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element \">\r\n<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\r\n<p>Sharp Technical Ltd are an electrical, structured cabling and home automation specialist based in Tamworth, Staffordshire. We aim to offer high-quality work at an exceptional standard. Whether you need a new fuse board, full rewire on a new high-end property or new fibre optic backbone installed into your factories, you can rely on us.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"vc_empty_space\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element \">\r\n<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\r\n<p>After gaining ten years of experience as a self-employed electrician and structured cabler, our Founder Mark Phillips took a leap of faith and established Sharp Technical in 2015. Mark&rsquo;s core principles are at the heart of everything we do, to be a company that offers a fast, friendly and cost-effective service to the public, commercial and industrial sectors.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"vc_empty_space\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element \">\r\n<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\r\n<p>Over the years, we have built a reputation nationwide as a trustworthy, approachable team who offer high-quality workmanship. Sharp Technical ltd took the next step which saw Daniel Dawes join the board of directors, and with Daniels knowledge and shared passion for the industry, Sharp Technical Ltd set out to expand.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"vc_empty_space\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element \">\r\n<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\r\n<p>Our first project saw us installing four high-end smart home apartments, along with a restaurant and concierge area at the Great Queen Street in Holborn, London. After delivering on time, and to a high specification, it paved the way for us to be entrusted to complete the electrical works on the&nbsp;<a href=\"https://sharp-technical.co.uk/portfolio/harris-academy-purfleet/\">Harris Academy in Purfleet, London.</a></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"vc_empty_space\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element \">\r\n<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\r\n<p>Since that first project in Holborn, we&rsquo;ve completed many projects with the latest being our most outstanding achievement to date; the electrical works at the new&nbsp;<a href=\"https://sharp-technical.co.uk/portfolio/leicester-city-fc-training-academy/\">state of the art 100million Leicester City Football Club training complex</a></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"vc_empty_space\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element \">\r\n<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\r\n<p>We now employ seven full-time staff and 5+ sub-contractors who continue to deliver all types of projects across the UK.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 1, 3, '2021-12-13 19:54:30', '{\"name\":\"SHARP TECHNICAL LTD\",\"email\":\"mark@sharp-technical.co.uk\",\"address\":\"Unit 3 Union Close, Tamworth, Staffordshire, England, B77 1BB\",\"mobile\":\"07876351654\",\"user\":{\"display_name\":\"Mark Phillips \",\"firstname\":\"mark\",\"lastname\":\"phillips\",\"password\":\"--------\",\"email\":\"107a2d31b4c70398312143f63f3ff772\"}}', '00000000000', 5),
