(17874, 'POPLARS CONSTRUCTION LTD.', 'c-linkoffice@tmpc.co.uk', 'Unit 1 Wilbury Way, Hitchin, SG4 0TW', '01525875999', '07769205673', '09870871', NULL, 'Poplars Construction are a leading Bedfordshire based company', 'www.poplarsconstruction.co.uk', '<p>Poplars Construction are a leading Bedfordshire based company who deliver skilled design and build solutions to commercial and private clients across the UK.</p><p><br></p><p>For the past 8 years our skilled team of architects, craftspeople and engineers have worked on a wide variety of projects including residential, commercial and new build developments, with a focus on providing a high quality and reliable service at competitive prices.</p><p><br></p><p>Every project we undertake is unique and we understand that all our clients have very different requirements, which is reflected in the personal and tailor-made approach we manage each project.</p>', 1, 3, '2021-12-15 18:55:43', NULL, NULL, 5),
