(17968, 'ADAPT FLOORING LTD', 'c-linkjosh@adaptflooring.co.uk', 'Unit 64 Sugarbrook Road, Bromsgrove, B60 3DN ', '01527388400', '07702 136800', '12671107', NULL, 'We Adapt to your flooring needs', 'www.adaptflooring.co.uk', '<p>We are a flooring company with a difference. Set up by two experienced flooring installers with the main aim to adapt and impress.</p>\r\n<p>Flooring can be a complicated trade and often the ideal isn&rsquo;t the reality. We are here to cross that boundary and create a successful working relationship with our clients in even the most challenging situations.</p>\r\n<p>We are based just south of Birmingham which puts us in a great place to service clients across the country, we have fitted floors from Dundee to Penzance and everywhere inbetween.</p>\r\n<p>We supply and fit a wide range of floor coverings to commercial businesses across the U.K. From carpets, both broad loam and tiles to offices and residential settings, to coved vinyl in hospitals and kitchen areas. We only work with reputable manufactures, that allow our works to be guaranteed because we want your flooring to last the test of time no matter what situation it sits in.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We have completed projects and reactive works in just about any environment, from power stations, hospitals, offices, schools, universities, cinemas, hotels and restaurants.</p>\r\n<p>Some people say timing is everything, but quite often the case with flooring, time is limited, whether you are replacing a kitchen floor during the night between shifts or installing a new set of carpets for a hotel to keep their customers happy. We have a lot of experience in handling time constraints and always keeping the client or customer in the loop.</p>', 1, 3, '2022-01-11 08:22:30', NULL, NULL, 5),
