(17971, 'POS Interiors', 'c-linkhello@posinteriors.com', 'Unit 9 Anfre Estate, Route de la Garenne, St Peter Port, Guernsey, GY1 2RL', '01481 740222', '', '12154 (Guernsey)', 'oie_1183031PMQLNFfC.jpg', NULL, 'www.posinteriors.com', 'POS Interiors was founded in 1983.\nWe are a specialist consultancy, interior design and fit-out company, providing services to clients in Guernsey & Jersey. We work in all industry sectors from international brands to small boutique outlets. We believe passionately in the power of creating inspiring work environments that inspire people to produce inspired work.', 0, 2, '2022-01-12 15:58:09', NULL, NULL, 5),
