(17974, 'ACM SCAFFOLDING LIMITED', 'c-linkacmscaffoldingltd@gmail.com', '75 Valley Drive,  Wilnecote,  B77 5FL,  Tamworth,  England', '07837 488337', '07837 488337', '12025626', NULL, 'We work to a industry reconsidered slandered no matter what the job is.', 'www.acmscaffolding.co.uk', '<p class=\"myclass\" style=\"font-family: sofia_pro_softlight;\">ACM Scaffolding are a Local Scaffolding Company in Birmingham, but covering the West Midlands and surrounding counties.&nbsp; We offer homeowners, businesses and local authorities the very best in comprehensive scaffolding services.&nbsp; ACM Scaffolding Ltd is a privately owned company with over several years&rsquo; experience providing scaffolding across the country. Providing an all-round service that delivers planning, design, erection, site attendance and dismantling.&nbsp; We work out of a strategically placed depot so that you can be sure of quick supply and lightning fast call-out response in the event of an emergency.</p>', 1, 3, '2022-01-16 18:45:16', NULL, NULL, 5),
