(17979, 'CITY DEMOLITION CONTRACTORS (BIRMINGHAM) LIMITED', 'c-linkpaul.macrae@citydemolition.co.uk', 'Birmingham,  Blews Street,  Aston,  B6 4EP,  West Midlands', '01213 337999', '07741 292855', '02324716', NULL, 'Think Safety Work Safely', 'www.citydemolition.co.uk', '<p>City Demolition Contractors have been trading since 1988 based in the heart of Birmingham offering a nation- wide coverage.</p>\r\n<p>we have a proven track record for being competitive, professional, and competent carrying out works efficiently and to a high standard for which we have achieved numerous safety and quality awards resulting in a high level of repeat business both in the public and private sectors and development sectors. We also provide full confidential cost appraisals assisting many of our clients in early planning through to completion.</p>\r\n<p>We carry out specialist demolition/ dismantle of all types of buildings and structures from single storey to high rise ranging from garages, houses, multi storey flats, tower blocks, commercial industrial and new developments in and around tight city centre locations.</p>\r\n<p>We also carry out soft strip removal for refurbishment&nbsp;contracts,&nbsp;fa&ccedil;ade retention on buildings which are being redeveloped along with site clearance and bulk excavation works, land reclamation, environmental and asbestos removal including contamination and chemical, crushing and recycling and have a recycling process which creates an achievable 95% of all operations.</p>\r\n<p>We have a continuous direct working labour force with many of our employees having worked for the company since its inception in 1988. This is a result in our commitment to both training and development of our employees and our investors in people programme.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We are members of the NFDC, NDTG, IDE, Construction Line, Chas, EDA, British safety Council, Safe Contractor, Considerate Contractors Scheme, UVDB Achilles, Investors in People and NQA ISO9001, ISO14001, AND OHSA18001.</p>\r\n<p>We have a further policy for safety within our company of <strong>&ldquo;Think Safety Work Safely&rdquo;</strong>, which all our employees sign up to and we endeavour and strive to carry our every individual contract to the highest standard and performance which can be achieved.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', 1, 3, '2022-01-18 15:55:57', NULL, NULL, 5),
