(17994, 'GRNPD', 'c-linkandrew.edwards@grnpd.com', 'Saxon House, Duke Street, Chelmsford, Essex, England, CM1 1HT', '0203 9824530', '', '13587832', 'GRNPD (150 × 150 px).png', NULL, 'www.grnpd.com', 'At GRNPD we specialise in the provision of expert planning, calculation and design services for residential and commercial projects. Utilising our pool of experts and engineers, we support the planning, calculation and design required at key stages of any construction project. Reliable, professional and flexible, we look to support and deliver high-quality work to support the construction of property throughout the UK.\nWith over a decade of experience, we can deliver full projects on time and on budget, no matter how big or small. From design to build, we are able to work with you and achieve your desired results.\nStructural Drawings and Calculations\nOur engineers use the latest technology such as Tekla, AutoCAD and Revit to deliver high-quality drawings and 3D illustrations. Ours services include planning, steel fabrication, concrete reinforcement and temporary works drawings. Our aim is to provide the best in quality design to help support the project, whatever the requirement.\nPlanning and applications\nWe can offer support across the planning & building control applications that are needed for any residential or commercial project. Furthermore, we cover ‘new builds’, house extensions, loft conversion projects and everything in between. Our services include application to the local authority, and acting as an agent for the duration of the project.\nProject Management\nConstruction requires serious leadership, and we can assist with the following: Creating Construction Benchmarks; Scheduling; Risk Management; Managing the Budget; Resource Optimisation; Managing and Communicating with Employees; Project Appraisal; Periodic Report on the Work Progress.', 0, 2, '2022-01-21 12:48:04', NULL, NULL, 5),
(17995, 'Harbourview Construction Limited', 'c-linkinfo@hvc.uk.com', 'Unit 17 Ground Floor,  Branksome Business Park,  Bourne Valley Road, Poole, Dorset, BH12 1DW', '01202 979106', '', '06917847', 'oie_2485522pfsMW8r5.jpg', NULL, 'www.hvc.uk.com', 'The Harbourview Construction Company is a family-owned and run company based on the south coast. With decades of experience providing expert construction services for bespoke luxury homes, industrial premises, commercial buildings and residential units, our speciality is providing expert construction services.\nOur outlook is simple: we operate with our old-fashioned values at our core with a modern outlook towards construction. We believe that flexibility and honesty are at the helm of our success, where every member of our team strives to build a prosperous working relationship with each of our clients.\nWe’re proud to provide professional construction services to clients looking to complete a range of building projects. We have brought together a highly skilled team that specialise in conversions, renovations, new builds and bespoke luxury homes.\nThanks to our strong work ethic, we will take on any building challenge and we have complete faith in our experienced team who have consistently delivered in apartments, flats, new builds and bespoke homes over the past three decades.', 0, 2, '2022-01-21 16:27:28', NULL, NULL, 5),
