(18157, 'Assets for Life Ltd', 'c-linkinfo@assetsforlife.co.uk', '2 Cromar Way, Unit 217, Waterhouse Business Centre, Chelmsford, Essex, CM1 2QE', '01245 408680', '', '09935286', 'oie_18111519oXOb0AzM.jpg', NULL, 'www.assetsforlife.co.uk', 'Assets for Life is an industry-leading, Forbes-featured property, business and wealth education company, based in the UK. We are dedicated to helping new and existing property investors and entrepreneurs to accelerate their success through world-class training, mentorship, strategies, tools and resources. \nWe are living proof that anyone can build life-changing income and achieve success, given the right education and mindset. Using tried and tested blueprints, we will show you how to thrive in property and business and alter the direction of your life for the better. With an extraordinary success rate from previous and existing candidates, our dedicated industry leading team will show you how to build sustainable property business assets. By asset we don’t just mean property; we also mean yourself – because fundamentally we believe that YOU are your greatest asset. \nAssets for Life promises a quality service from the outset, welcoming you into our family and building a win-win relationship that lasts. Did we mention we are the UK’s highest star rated property, business and wealth training company?  ', 0, 2, '2022-02-17 17:54:46', NULL, NULL, 5),
