(18205, 'INTELLIGENT ELECTRICAL SOLUTIONS LTD', 'c-linkinfo@iesolutions.co.uk', 'Bromsgrove,  England,  Worcestershire,  50 Princethorpe Street,  B61 0FH', '07540 237487', '07791 028878', '12245784', NULL, 'You\'ll find our services enlightening', 'www.iesolutions.co.uk', '<p>Welcome to Intelligent Electrical Solutions Ltd. We are fully insured, trained and certified NAPIT approved electricians and pride ourselves in carrying out and completing all jobs to a high professional standard. Based in Bromsgrove, Worcestershire, IES Ltd cover all local areas as well as neighbouring counties in the West Midlands.</p>\r\n<p>IES Ltd are able to provide a free no obligation quote for all enquiries as well as offering guidance or sourcing any specific materials for the job, e.g. lights, sockets, etc. I am dedicated to client satisfaction and regularly keep up to date with training and legislation related to my electrical profession - this ensures I carry out a high level of service.</p>\r\n<p>Services we offer include:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Full or part rewires</li>\r\n<li>Emergency call outs</li>\r\n<li>All aspects of lighting</li>\r\n<li>Smart home systems</li>\r\n<li>CCTV</li>\r\n<li>EICR inspection &amp; testing</li>\r\n<li>Fault Finding</li>\r\n<li>Consumer unit upgrades</li>\r\n<li>EV car charger installs</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, 3, '2022-03-02 11:48:41', NULL, NULL, 5),
