(18241, 'RC VICTORIAN BRICKWORK LTD', 'c-linkrcvictorianbrickwork@gmail.com', 'NN4 9YA,  23 Sarek Park,  England,  Northampton', '07477 992020', '07477 992020', '11568733', NULL, 'We build quality homes', '', '<div>\r\n<p class=\"myclass\">RCvictorianbrickwork &nbsp;LTD has been incorporated in 2018 by Roman Cebotar who has more than 15 years worth of experience in construction.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"myclass\">&nbsp;We specialise brickwork and block work, mainly new build houses Our early turnover is reaching around 585k &nbsp;and we have 20 employees. &nbsp;The head office is based in Northampton and we cover areas as Luton, Bedford, Milton Keynes, Watford ,St Albans, Hemel Hempstead, Aylesbury .</p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"myclass\">RCvictorianbricwork &nbsp;brings an extensive base of highly skilled staff to bear in order to bring the requirements of our clients into life . On site we bring a high level of management to ensure that the programme is met without compromising safety or quality on the largest and most complex projects . We are CHAS and SMAS accredited which demonstrate our health and safety compliance.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"myclass\">Our team has completed works for United Living (75 new builds apartments), Berkley (40 houses), Hallstone for Linden Homes in Bicester (50 houses) and many more.</p>\r\n</div>', 1, 3, '2022-03-17 11:32:27', NULL, NULL, 5),
