(18285, 'JEM Electrical ', 'c-linkadmin@jemelectrical.co.uk', 'B77 1AG,  Tamworth,  Kettlebrook Road,  Unit 7 Swan Park Business Centre,  England', '01827 259033', '07557 342061', '11568634', NULL, '\"the brighter choice....\"', 'www.jemelectrical.co.uk', '<div id=\"profile-work-history\" class=\"profile-section profile-section--about\">\r\n<h3 class=\"heading heading-small clearfix\">About JEM Electrical \"The brighter choice\" Limited</h3>\r\n<p>Established since May 2005, JEM Electrical \"the brighter choice\" Limited is the ultimate in a professional service when it comes to the electrical trade and with over 24 years experience in the Domestic, Commercial, Security &amp; Industrial sectors we have the rights to call ourselves specialists. We always use the best quality electrical materials and ensure we carry only the best tools to do our job neatly and efficiently first time every time. We can carry out any electrical work no matter how big or small the project to the highest standard and value for money. We offer FREE No obligation consultations. We aim to offer affordable and realistic prices to our clients which are usually turned around within 24 hours from initial site visit. We are fully approved NICEIC &amp; Part P domestic installer registered contractors, OLEZ Registered so able to apply for EVC government grants and registered with Trustmark so you can rest assure you are in the safe hands. All of our work is guaranteed and backed by the NICEIC\'s 6 year Platinum promise Guarantee. Choose JEM Electrical for all your jobs, no matter how big or small, additional sockets and lighting, fuse board upgrades, testing, inspection &amp; certification, security alarms and lighting, rewires full/part, FREE advice, design service and so much more....we will always be happy to help and you\'ll be happy you chose JEM Electrical \"the brighter choice\" Limited. Our reputation and reviews speak for themselves, get in touch today, we welcome all inquiries 24/7, 365 days a year, No call out charges, just an honest, reliable &amp; friendly service that you\'ll be guaranteed to be satisfied with and willing to recommend to friends and family and use again time after time.</p>\r\n<p>Services include:-</p>\r\n<p>* Domestic- Commercial &amp; Industrial <br />* Additional sockets &amp; lighting <br />* LED lighting upgrades <br />* Electrical design service <br />* Consumer unit upgrades <br />* Full and part re-wires <br />* External lighting and power <br />* Security Lighting <br />* Intruder alarms <br />* CCTV <br />* E.I.C.R reports <br />* Inspection &amp; testing <br />* Power distribution <br />* E.V charging points (Registered ROLEC installers) <br />* Fire Alarms <br />* Intruder alarms <br />* Containment systems <br />* 3 phase distribution <br />* Ventilation <br />* Heating</p>\r\n<p>And much more....we can also offer finance on all larger scale projects to allow our clients to spread the cost and make those costly home improvement more affordable. For all your electrical requirements don\'t hesitate to get in touch!</p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div id=\"profile-qualifications\" class=\"profile-section profile-section--qualifications\">\r\n<h3 class=\"heading heading-small clearfix\">Qualifications</h3>\r\n<p>City &amp; Guilds NVQ Levels 1,2 &amp; 3 <br />NICEIC Domestic Installer D603504 <br />NICEIC Approved Contractor 608175000 <br />Registered Members of the ECA <br />City &amp; Guilds 18th Edition I.E.E wiring reg&rsquo;s <br />City &amp; Guilds Electric Vehicle charging <br />ECS/CSCS <br />Safe Contractor Approved <br />Trust Mark Approved <br />IPAF Qualified <br />PASMA Qualified <br />First Aid Qualified <br />ROLEC Approved Installers <br />OLEV Accredited <br />Over 22 years experience.</p>\r\n</div>', 1, 3, '2022-04-05 09:24:04', NULL, NULL, 5),
