(18398, 'BD CONSTRUCTION SERVICES LTD', 'c-linkgeorge@bdconstruct.co.uk', 'Harlow,  Summit House,  Horsecroft Road,  CM19 5BN,  England,  Essex', '02080 501014', '07578 562989', '13103197', NULL, 'Commercial Construction and Subcontract Services', 'www.bdconstruct.co.uk', '<p class=\"myclass\" style=\"font-family: sofia_pro_softlight;\">The BD Group is formed of 3 companies trading as one allround entity to our clients providing a range of main contract &amp; subcontract services:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li class=\"myclass\" style=\"font-family: sofia_pro_softlight;\">BD Construction - is the Main Contractor element which also caters for all builders work, structural and carpentry trades</li>\r\n<li class=\"myclass\" style=\"font-family: sofia_pro_softlight;\">BD Creative Solutions - specialises in interior works including drylining, ceilings &amp; plastering.</li>\r\n<li class=\"myclass\" style=\"font-family: sofia_pro_softlight;\">BD Commercial Finishes - commercial and residential flooring including all aspects of vinyl, carpet and specialist floor finishes.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p class=\"myclass\" style=\"font-family: sofia_pro_softlight;\">Due to the nature of our setup and the trades available to us, BD are also capable of taking on whole project packages on for of contractors looking to outsource work.</p>', 1, 3, '2022-05-12 18:43:37', '', '46954 29285', 5),
