(18437, 'JMC RENOVATIONS LIMITED', 'c-linkJmcrenovationsltd@yahoo.co.uk', 'SUNNY VIEW, HUXLEY LANE, TARPORLEY, CW6 9UG', '07792 991799', '44779 299179', '08083924', NULL, 'We make upgrading your electrical installation quick, efficient and hassle free.', 'www.jmcrenovations.co.uk', '<p><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: sofia_pro_softlight;\">We specialise in all electrical installation work from full rewires to extra sockets in your home.&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"myclass\" style=\"font-family: sofia_pro_softlight;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: sofia_pro_softlight;\">We understand that you don&rsquo;t want the world. Just an electrician who turns on time. Does a good job. Cleans up after themselves, and doesn&rsquo;t charge a fortune. Rest assured we have you covered. With years of experience, registered with competent person scheme, and Napit certified. So know that your property is in the safest hands.&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: sofia_pro_softlight;\">We meet all the requirements for Part P of the building regulations.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"myclass\" style=\"font-family: sofia_pro_softlight;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: sofia_pro_softlight;\">We will notify all necessary work to your local council building control department and ensure that all necessary documentation is completed and submitted.</span></p>', 1, 3, '2022-06-08 19:25:46', NULL, NULL, 5),
