(18539, 'Alium Group Ltd', 'c-linkinfo@aliumgroup.co.uk', '8-10 Whiteladies Road, Bristol, Bristol, United Kingdom, BS8 1PD', '07414 190851', '', '10778331', 'oie_1818537Ce1LrMJD.jpg', NULL, 'www.aliumgroup.co.uk', 'Why did we set up Alium Group? To provide what we saw was lacking: a consultancy that speaks the same language as its clients. Our honest and straight-talking approach creates confidence, leading to productive long-term relationships with our clients.\nWhen you work with the construction industry, you need an understanding of its processes and culture. You can’t simply parachute into a project, claiming expertise. You need to work closely with your clients, supporting their projects with both respect and honesty.\nThe expertise through years of experience combined with a highly personable team that build on good relationships with all parties of the construction industry – clients, funders, other professionals, contractors and further supply chain members. This approach wins confidence and respect which assists the succesful delivery of our projects.', 1, 2, '2022-07-12 15:24:39', NULL, NULL, 5),
