(18655, 'Living Danish Developments', 'c-linklgraabek@livingdanish.co.uk', '68 Barnmead, Haywards Heath, England, RH16 1UZ', '07539435976', '', '08773330', 'ezgif.com-gif-maker.jpg', NULL, 'www.livingdanish.co.uk', 'Living Danish Developments is an independent investment and property development company based in London. We specialise in residential and mixed use schemes with a Scandinavian flair to unlock value.\nThe company was established by Danish brothers Lars and Kristian Graabek, whose vision is to build elegant and spacious yet affordable housing and mixed use developments for people appreciating Nordic feel and practical living. Our developments combine exceptional design by Danish architects and the company founders’ extensive experience of property development in the UK and in Denmark.', 1, 2, '2022-05-16 16:26:38', NULL, NULL, 5);
