(19395, '109 Cathedral Road Holdings Limited and 126 Cathedral Road Holdings Limited', 'c-linkinfo@thriveassets.co.uk', '15 Neptune Court, Vanguard Way, Cardiff, CF24 5PJ', '02921 150 595', NULL, ' 12208191 and 13375795', 'Involve Logistics - White (SMALL) - BLANK.png', NULL, '', 'At Involve Logistics, we pride ourselves on providing high quality services tailored to meet the budgetary needs of all clients, covering the following services.\nWe are unlike many other construction logistics providers, we take ownership of the logistics required to ensure your site is run efficiently and safely allowing you to deliver your project on time and on budget, we understand the issues that main contractor have on their project and we are the one stop shop take this issue away and supply’s a solutions.\nInvolve Logistics understands that delivering top-notch service is all about the skills, knowledge, reliability and commitment of our team. At Involve logistics we understand that to make our projects successful we need to have the correct employees for all our sites , we have a total of Fifty Seven thousand employers on our database that we will interview on a project by project basis to ensure that are correct for a specific Project. We aren’t like any other construction logistics company we have developed our own NVQ in construction logistics to ensure we are up skilling our employees and furthering their career in construction logistics.', 1, 2, '2022-10-11 11:39:26', NULL, NULL, 5),
(19396, 'CULENA LONDON', 'c-linkinfo@culenalondon.co.uk', '37 Upper Brook Street, London, England, W1K 7PR', '0207 858 9954', NULL, '09925643', 'oie_1114151BFX9tcTJ.png', NULL, 'www.culenalondon.co.uk', 'Culena London are a main contractor who bring energy, honesty and transparency into developing and delivering bespoke projects to the highest quality. We create exquisite homes for our clients in a number of major prime locations within central London. With an abundance of industry knowledge, a great team and a respected presence in the luxury residential market we take pride in providing a unique service to our clients.\nThe company was established at the start of 2018 by three former colleagues: Brian Higgins, Derek Finnegan and Steven Murphy. After realising that their passion for building, attention to detail and moral compasses were aligned, they founded Culena London.\nCulena London specialise in design, build and refurbishment of residential and commercial properties located in the prime London market. We are a professional and approachable business allowing us to collaborate and work with our clients in achieving pristine projects. \nCulena London has been involved in numerous projects ranging from private residential fit-out to multi-million pound hotel schemes. With this in mind we have pleasure in presenting to you our project gallery.', 0, 2, '2022-10-11 11:41:46', NULL, NULL, 5),
