(20683, 'Land Matters', 'c-linksebastien@land-matters.co.uk', '32 Park Farm Road, Bromley, England, BR1 2PE', '020 3858 7960', NULL, '09863516', 'ezgif.com-gif-maker.jpg', NULL, 'www.land-matters.co.uk', 'Land Matters acquires land to create high quality new homes whilst delivering shared value and superior returns for land owners and investors\nOur business model brings together smart investing with property development components efficiently and effectively. Our proposition is unique as it brings together land owners and investors to create value, which is then shared.\nWe carefully select residential development sites in prime locations and maximise their value by repurposing and implementing creative planning and capital structuring solutions. Our offer price to the land owner reflects this potential.\nWe work directly with land owners rather than intermediaries, securing planning and developing the property with funding from investors. As a result all participants are rewarded for their contribution.\nA rigid risk management framework is at the heart of everything we do to provide security for our investors and our business partners.', 1, 2, '2022-10-24 07:45:01', NULL, NULL, 5),
