(20769, 'SMOOTH SMILING WALLS LTD', 'c-linkEnquiries@smoothsmilingwalls.co.uk', '20 Portman Drive, Woodford Green, IG8 8QR', NULL, '07739083131', '13766381', NULL, 'Finishing projects with integrity and high standards...', 'www.smoothsmilingwalls.co.uk', '<p>We provide a high quality, competitively priced property maintenance, development and refurbishment service to both domestic and commercial clients from a wide variety of sectors in London and the</p><p>South East.</p><p><br></p><p>At SSW we look after our clients by delivering a consistently, high quality service at competitive prices. SSW has a refurbishment/development department covering all aspects of building work for both minor and major works, additionally, whether that be providing advice or technical support.</p><p><br></p><p>We also operate on emergency property maintenance service with availability to help with electrical repairs, plumbing and drainage, providing highly skilled tradesmen for roofing repairs, including major flooding and wall damages for insurance purposes and house refurbishment/remodeling projects.</p><p><br></p><p>We use only qualified engineers and experienced tradesman (with relevant certification) to carry out works to both residential and commercial properties on behalf of private owners, tenants and landlords.</p><h2><br></h2><h2>Management</h2><p>Running SSW is a stable and motivated management team whose members between them have vast experience in all of the company’s areas of operation. We recognize that every instruction is unique, so for each contract we tailor a team with exactly the right blend of skills and expertise. Our senior managers can draw on a fund of combined experience in the property industry. This enables us to identify key issues and a comprehensive list of do’s and don’ts to ensure we get it right the first time.</p><p><br></p><p>The industry in which we operate is people focused. While we are of course keen to attract new clients, we are just as anxious to look after our existing ones. Our philosophy is simple: to offer a high-quality, cost-effective service to all our clients, by ensuring we finish with integrity.</p><h2><br></h2><h2>Our Guarantee</h2><p>All our work is guaranteed to the highest standards. We have adopted a Quality Management System, designed to meet the requirements of trading standards and we the directors and management of SSW Ltd are committed to providing consistently safe and legal services of the highest quality. The company acknowledges its responsibility services to meet its customer’s expectations in respect of all aspects of its business. To this end the directors have defined a series of quality objectives as set out in the Quality Policy Statement that are regularly reviewed and communicated throughout the organisations.</p><p><br></p>', 1, 3, '2022-11-12 00:29:40', NULL, NULL, 5),
