(21241, 'SOUTHERN GROUP SW LIMITED', 'c-linkInfo@southerngroupuk.com', 'Flat 4 St. Oswalds Court, Bristol, BS13 7ER', NULL, '07949296340', '14579761', NULL, 'Great service ', 'Www.southerngroupuk.co.uk', '<p>Southern group offering straight line solutions for external walls and roofs. Whether it\'s domestic or commercial&nbsp;we recognize that good business is built not only on hard work, integrity and an excellent standard of workmanship, but also on confidence. We are also working with leading manufacturers to bring the most pristine coverings we possibly can.&nbsp;</p><p>We look forward to hearing from your self’s offering straight line solutions for external walls and roofs. Whether it\'s domestic or commercial&nbsp;we recognize that good business is built not only on hard work, integrity and an excellent standard of workmanship, but also on confidence. We are also working with leading manufacturers to bring the most pristine coverings we possibly can.&nbsp;</p><p>We look forward to hearing from your self’s</p>', 1, 3, '2023-01-13 16:08:20', NULL, NULL, 5),
