(21255, 'ARMINA LTD', 'c-linkandy@armina.co.uk', '396B Baring Road, London, England, SE12 0EF', '02084801047', '07983482241', '11905956', NULL, 'Armina Group have a dedicated Special Projects team who are set-up specifically to deliver refurbishment and major repair projects for our customers. They are all experienced construction and building professionals with a track record of delivering a quality finish, a safe working environment and meeting demanding client requirements.', 'www.arminagroup.com', '<p>We are also specialists in the installation of all types of timber and soft floor coverings, as well as raised acoustic flooring and underfloor heating into high-rise, luxury multi-unit residential and hospitality projects including offices. </p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>We employ industry leading specialists for all facets of flooring and are capable of delivering your project in a controlled and disciplined manner and are able to provide advice as well as solutions that can generate cost savings without compromise to quality and design.</p>', 1, 4, '2023-01-19 16:42:07', '{\"17696\":{\"name\":\"ARMINA LTD\",\"email\":\"barry@armina.co.uk\",\"address\":\"B Baring Road, London, England, SE12 0EF\",\"mobile\":\"07983482248\",\"user\":{\"display_name\":\"Barry Peel\",\"firstname\":\"Barry Peel\",\"lastname\":\"\",\"email\":\"barry@armina.co.uk\"}}}', NULL, 5),
