(21369, 'QUINN (LONDON) LIMITED', 'c-linkinfo@quinnlondon.co.uk', 'Dome House, 8 Hartley Avenue, Mill Hill, London, England, NW7 2HX', '020 8238 1950', '07824 460 997', '04005400', 'oie_27114932ovVYQZQg (2).jpg', NULL, 'www.quinnlondon.co.uk', 'Founded in 2000, Quinn London has excelled to become one of the leading main contractors in London by combining specialist expertise with a fresh-thinking ethos and a client focused approach to delivering excellence.\nBuilding the future of London\nWe’re always keen to see the bigger picture, adding value to projects wherever we can by drawing upon our years of experience in delivering construction works across London. We have carefully expanded our operations to organically build skill and equity in our business and be more competitive in the market. As a result, we offer an invaluable reputation of certainty, reliability and transparency, meaning that with us, clients know they are in secure hands.\nDelivering with purpose\nOur people make the difference between good and great project delivery. Our experienced and knowledgeable teams have a zest and drive to get involved, breaking down barriers to work closely together to achieve the best possible solutions. Operating as one flexible and agile team, including partners, suppliers, and other stakeholders too, we’re passionate about doing business the right way and creating a built environment we can all be proud of.', 1, 2, '2023-03-27 08:36:09', NULL, NULL, 15),
