(21403, 'ROC CONTRACTS LTD', 'c-linkshane@roc-contracts.com', '59 Belagherty Road, Magherafelt, United Kingdom, BT45 6JJ', NULL, NULL, 'NI647791', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, 4, '2023-04-06 11:09:19', '{\"21312\":{\"name\":\"ROC CONTRACTS LTD\",\"email\":\"shane@roc-contracts.com\",\"address\":\"59 Belagherty Road, Magherafelt, United Kingdom, BT45 6JJ\",\"mobile\":\"07841641612\",\"user\":{\"display_name\":\"Shane Rocks\",\"firstname\":\"Shane Rocks\",\"lastname\":\"\",\"email\":\"shane@roc-contracts.com\"}}}', NULL, 5),
(21404, 'PURE FITOUT ASSOCIATED LIMITED', 'c-linkDenise@purefitout.com', 'Unit 1 Building 1 Central Park Mallusk, Newtownabbey, Northern Ireland, BT36 4FS', '02895072600', '02895072606', 'NI632500', NULL, 'Vision, Design, Creation', 'www.purefitout.com', '<p> With over 100 Staff, our team boasts some of the most knowledgeable and experienced figures in the construction industry and offer invaluable advice across all aspects of interior fitout and construction.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>We have contract managers, full quantity surveying and estimating teams as well as CAD technicians, project engineers and interior designers to support and deliver client projects on time and within budget. Our In-house capabilities include bespoke joinery, metal fabrication and steel window systems manufacture with continuous capital reinvestment and skills training in the latest technologies and machinery. We operate from a fully equipped 50,000 sq ft manufacturing plant based in Belfast. Here we have a team of experienced and skilled Joiners and metal fabricators who design and create spectacular pieces of craftsmanship for numerous clients, as well as nurturing the next generation of tradespeople with a yearly intake of apprentices from local areas. </p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>On the business side, our team consists of operations, finance and commercial directors with almost 100 years combined experience in the construction sector. Our support divisions consist of talented individuals and teams incorporating all aspects of business including sales, marketing, accounts and administration. </p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>We have a team of experienced construction professionals that can manage new build schemes from concept to competition. Our team manages major new build, fast track construction projects across multiple industry sectors. </p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Our construction teams are supported by our fitout division specializing in interior fitout and refurbishment. We deliver bespoke fitouts across a variety of sectors and industries to clients and partners throughout the UK, Ireland and Europe.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>We will manage the programme, cost and quality of the whole project. These in-house services and experience allows us to offer the client a smooth process from start to finish.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>  </p>', 1, 4, '2023-04-06 11:12:23', '{\"21312\":{\"name\":\"PURE FITOUT ASSOCIATED LIMITED\",\"email\":\"Denise@purefitout.com\",\"address\":\"Unit 1 Building 1 Central Park Mallusk, Newtownabbey, Northern Ireland, BT36 4FS\",\"mobile\":\"02895072600\",\"user\":{\"display_name\":\"Denise Haslett\",\"firstname\":\"Denise Haslett\",\"lastname\":\"\",\"email\":\"Denise@purefitout.com\"}}}', NULL, 5),
