(21426, 'DIMENSION BRICKWORK LTD', 'c-linkOffice@dimension-brickwork.co.uk', '26, Market Place, Swaffham, England, PE37 7QH', '0', '07585334705', '14134653', NULL, 'providing quality brickwork in a quick and efficient way', 'https://www.instagram.com/dimensionbrickworkltd/', '<p>We are a Norfolk based brickwork contractor that covers all areas of Norfolk &amp; North Suffolk.</p><p>We source bricklaying gangs for housebuilder&nbsp;companies providing quality brickwork for their new home sites in a quick and efficient way. Our complete range of brickwork services incorporates all types of bricklaying,blockwork, brick repairs,brick cleaning and many more besides.</p><p>Dimension Brickwork is CHAS accredited, SSSTS trained and works to NHBC standards. Our work has been highly graded resulting in nation leading housebuilder\'s site agents awarded with the attendance and short listed for the NHBC awards.</p>', 1, 4, '2023-04-19 15:22:57', '{\"21420\":{\"name\":\"DIMENSION BRICKWORK LTD\",\"email\":\"Office@dimension-brickwork.co.uk\",\"address\":\"26, Market Place, Swaffham, England, PE37 7QH\",\"mobile\":\" 07585334705\",\"user\":{\"display_name\":\"Jon Macfarlane\",\"firstname\":\"Jon Macfarlane\",\"lastname\":\"\",\"email\":\"Office@dimension-brickwork.co.uk\"}}}', NULL, 5),
