(21471, 'RBJ DEVELOPMENTS LTD', 'c-linkinfo@bluerockhomes.co.uk', '6th Floor Arden House    Regent Centre, Newcastle Upon Tyne, NE3 3LU', '0191 8090290', '07949 270737', '09645438', 'Bluerock-logo-default@4x - C-Link.png', NULL, 'www.bluerockhomes.co.uk', 'Stylish, sustainable & affordable Eco Friendly Living…\nAt Bluerock Homes we specialise in designing and building Eco-friendly, thermally efficient and sustainable properties that not only prepare for the future, but assist in saving it.  From our design principles right through to the build, we always strive to create something which is not only suitable for individual needs, but can help to save money and the environment.  Using the right materials, sustainable technology and smart design, our objective is to create developments that are in harmony with their surroundings.\nOur aim is to provide high quality, as standard. Whether this be a high electrical specification using LED lighting and multiple socket points; feature finishes using glass, timber or concrete; or providing quartz worktops, our homes will give you more in a way you’ve never experienced before.\nDuring the pre-construction phase of our projects, we work with our designers to ensure there is a focus on sustainable construction methods. The use of highly insulative timber frames producing thermal values over and above Building Regulations minimum standards, triple glazing, mechanical heat ventilation and recovery systems, solar panels and other renewable energy sources, are considered and implemented into our builds where possible. ', 1, 2, '2023-05-02 15:06:59', NULL, NULL, 5),
