(21492, 'A.EDMONDS & CO.LIMITED', 'c-linkmark.woof@edmonds.uk.com', '89 - 91 Constitution Hill, Birmingham B19 3JY', '0121 236 8351', '07831 864557', '00134794', NULL, 'n/a', 'www.edmonds.uk.com', '<p class=\"ql-align-justify\">A. Edmonds &amp; Co. Ltd are constructional shopfitters, manufacturing and installing high quality bespoke joinery and architectural metalwork.</p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">Operating out of 10,000 square metres of floor space the Company has its own veneering, moulding, pressing, bonding and specialist finishing departments as well as an in-house AutoCAD design and full setting out department. This means that by working closely with other specialist trades, projects of differing degrees of complexity can be undertaken and managed. </p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><br></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">The Company is able to undertake new construction, restoration and refurbishment projects, provided it is of a high quality bespoke nature</p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">We focus and specialise in the manufacture of bronze, brass, and stainless steel shopfronts, doors and frames to any detail, as well as working on a diverse range of products and contracts from bespoke display counters and cabinets, bars and counters, reception and boardroom furniture, all of which we can offer on a supply only or supply and install basis.</p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><br></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">We utilise numerous precious metals such as bronze, brass, copper, stainless steel, zinc and pewter, together with a vast selection of hardwoods and veneers.</p><p><br></p>', 1, 4, '2023-05-09 09:10:35', '{\"21369\":{\"name\":\"A.EDMONDS & CO.LIMITED\",\"email\":\"mark.woof@edmonds.uk.com\",\"address\":\"91 Constitution Hill, Birmingham, B19 3JY\",\"mobile\":\"07831 864557\",\"user\":{\"display_name\":\"Mark Woof\",\"firstname\":\"Mark Woof\",\"lastname\":\"\",\"email\":\"mark.woof@edmonds.uk.com\"}}}', NULL, 5),
