(21712, 'GREEN SPARK ELECTRICAL CONTRACTOR LTD', 'c-linkinfo@greensparkelec.co.uk', '28 Rolvenden Road, Rochester, ME2 4PD', 'N/A', '07969867686', '13955036', NULL, 'Green by name, Green by nature. ', 'www.greensparkelec.co.uk', '<p>Green Spark Electrical Contractor Ltd. is an established company that specialises in providing high-quality electrical services. Founded in October 2018, the company quickly gained recognition for its commitment to delivering exceptional workmanship. In March 2022, Green Spark Electrical Contractor Ltd. achieved limited status, further demonstrating its growth and development in the industry.</p><p><br></p><p>The company prides itself on its ability to consistently deliver projects on time, ensuring that clients can rely on their services for timely completion of electrical works. Green Spark Electrical Contractor Ltd. is known for its attention to detail and dedication to providing top-notch service to its customers.</p><p><br></p><p>With a team of skilled and experienced professionals, the company is equipped to handle a wide range of electrical projects, including installations, repairs, and maintenance. Green Spark Electrical Contractor Ltd. strives to exceed customer expectations, offering reliable and efficient solutions that meet the highest standards of quality.</p><p><br></p><p>Additionally, the company places a strong emphasis on sustainability and environmental responsibility. As the name suggests, Green Spark Electrical Contractor Ltd. is committed to adopting environmentally friendly practices, promoting energy-efficient solutions, and minimizing its carbon footprint.</p><p><br></p><p>Overall, Green Spark Electrical Contractor Ltd. is a reputable company that has established itself as a trusted provider of high-quality electrical services. With its commitment to excellence, professionalism, and environmental sustainability, the company stands out as a reliable choice for all electrical needs.</p>', 1, 3, '2023-06-20 12:18:39', NULL, NULL, 5),
