(21972, 'CUSTOMISED ELECTRICAL SYSTEMS LTD', 'c-linkinfo@customisedelectrics.co.uk', 'Craftwork Studios, 1-3 Dufferin Street, London, EC1Y 8NA', NULL, NULL, '06316580', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, 4, '2023-07-26 04:06:57', '{\"21685\":{\"name\":\"CUSTOMISED ELECTRICAL SYSTEMS LTD\",\"email\":\"info@customisedelectrics.co.uk\",\"address\":\"Craftwork Studios, 1-3 Dufferin Street, London, EC1Y 8NA\",\"mobile\":\"02033 703719\",\"user\":{\"display_name\":\"Matt Clarke\",\"firstname\":\"Matt Clarke\",\"lastname\":\"\",\"email\":\"info@customisedelectrics.co.uk\"}}}', NULL, 5),
(21973, 'DESIGNER ELECTRICAL LIMITED', 'c-linkmike@designerelectrical.co.uk', 'Unit 3a, Merrow Business Centre, Merrow Lane Guildford, Surrey, GU4 7WA', '01483505443', '01483505443', '03055526', NULL, '', 'designerelectrical.co.uk', '<p>Established in 1988, originally catering to small domestic projects and customers from the light industrial sector. Now undertaking large contracts within the residential and commercial/industrial sectors. Based in Guildford, we provide services in the South East, with a large proportion of our work taking place in London.</p><p><br></p><p>In 1997 we became a NICEIC approved contractor and in 2018 we gained BAFE accreditation for the supply/installation of Fire Alarms.</p><p><br></p><p>We take Health &amp; Safety very seriously for all our employees and clients, to that end we have SafeContractor and SMAS accreditations together with our H&amp;S Consultants, to ensure our practices and procedures adhere to current legislation.&nbsp;All employees receive up to date training with regular inspection of procedures.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>&nbsp;All electricians are qualified to City &amp; Guilds accreditation together with 18th Edition IEE regulations.&nbsp;We offer two to three electrical apprenticeships per year to school leavers/young people on a day release basis, offering on the job training to gain necessary qualifications to become fully qualified electricians. To date Designer Electrical has trained over forty apprentices</p>', 1, 4, '2023-07-26 04:11:50', '{\"21685\":{\"name\":\"DESIGNER ELECTRICAL LIMITED\",\"email\":\"mike@designerelectrical.co.uk\",\"address\":\"Unit 3a, Merrow Business Centre, Merrow Lane Guildford, Surrey, GU4 7WA\",\"mobile\":\"01483 505443\",\"user\":{\"display_name\":\"Mike O\'Brien\",\"firstname\":\"Mike O\'Brien\",\"lastname\":\"\",\"email\":\"mike@designerelectrical.co.uk\"}}}', NULL, 5),
