(21986, 'OAKTREE ELECTRICAL LIMITED', 'c-linkinfo@oaktree-electrical.co.uk', 'St James\'s House, 8 Overcliffe, Gravesend, Kent, DA11 0HJ', NULL, NULL, '03242227', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, 4, '2023-07-26 04:49:09', '{\"21685\":{\"name\":\"OAKTREE ELECTRICAL LIMITED\",\"email\":\"info@oaktree-electrical.co.uk\",\"address\":\"St James\'s House, 8 Overcliffe, Gravesend, Kent, DA11 0HJ\",\"mobile\":\"01322 552888\",\"user\":{\"display_name\":\"Oaktree\",\"firstname\":\"Oaktree\",\"lastname\":\"\",\"email\":\"info@oaktree-electrical.co.uk\"}}}', NULL, 5),
(21987, 'RAYTELL ELECTRICAL CO. LIMITED', 'c-linkinfo@raytell.co.uk', '9, Hampden Way, Southgate, London, N14 5DJ', '0208 361 1113', '07957 383182', '01123738', NULL, 'Electrical installations', 'www.raytell.co.uk', '<p><span style=\"color: var(--tw-prose-bold);\">Raytell Electrical Co Limited: Delivering Excellence in Electrical Services for 50 Years</span></p><p>Established in 1973, Raytell Electrical Co Limited stands as a pioneer in the electrical industry, boasting an impressive track record of five decades of exemplary service. With a commitment to excellence and a passion for innovation, Raytell has become a trusted name in the field, offering a comprehensive range of electrical works to residential, commercial, and industrial clients alike.</p><p><span style=\"color: var(--tw-prose-bold);\">History and Expertise:</span></p><p>Over the past 50 years, Raytell Electrical has consistently demonstrated its proficiency in all aspects of electrical works. The company was founded by Ray Bundock and Terry Deacon,  experienced electrical engineers with a vision to provide top-tier electrical solutions to the community. </p><p><span style=\"color: var(--tw-prose-bold);\">Range of Services:</span></p><p>Raytell Electrical Co Limited offers an extensive array of electrical services, making them a one-stop-shop for all electrical needs. Their diverse offerings include, but are not limited to:</p><ol><li><span style=\"color: var(--tw-prose-bold);\">Residential Services:</span> From electrical installations and lighting solutions to smart home automation, Raytell enhances the safety, efficiency, and comfort of residential spaces.</li><li><span style=\"color: var(--tw-prose-bold);\">Commercial Services:</span> Understanding the unique requirements of businesses, Raytell provides comprehensive electrical solutions for offices, retail spaces, and commercial establishments, including electrical fit-outs, data cabling, and energy-efficient lighting installations.</li><li><span style=\"color: var(--tw-prose-bold);\">Energy Efficiency Solutions:</span> In keeping with the growing demand for sustainable practices, Raytell assists clients in implementing energy-efficient solutions, contributing to reduced energy consumption and cost savings.</li></ol><p><span style=\"color: var(--tw-prose-bold);\">Commitment to Safety and Quality:</span></p><p>Safety is paramount at Raytell Electrical Co Limited. The company adheres to strict safety protocols and regulations to protect both its workforce and clients. Their team of highly skilled and certified electricians undergo continuous training to stay updated with the latest industry standards and technologies, ensuring the highest quality of workmanship in every project they undertake.</p><p><span style=\"color: var(--tw-prose-bold);\">Customer Satisfaction:</span></p><p>Raytell\'s dedication to exceptional customer service has been a cornerstone of their success. They value long-term relationships with clients and prioritize clear communication, transparency, and reliability throughout every project. By truly understanding their clients\' needs, Raytell ensures tailor-made solutions that meet and exceed expectations.</p><p><span style=\"color: var(--tw-prose-bold);\">Community Involvement:</span></p><p>Beyond their commitment to clients, Raytell actively engages in community initiatives, supporting educational programs and charitable endeavors to give back to society and create a positive impact.</p><p><span style=\"color: var(--tw-prose-bold);\">Conclusion:</span></p><p>Raytell Electrical Co Limited\'s five decades of excellence in the electrical industry stand as a testament to their unwavering commitment to quality, safety, and innovation. With a broad spectrum of services, a dedicated team of experts, and a strong reputation, Raytell continues to be the go-to choice for all electrical needs, promising reliable and cutting-edge solutions for the years to come.</p>', 1, 4, '2023-07-26 04:52:18', '{\"21685\":{\"name\":\"RAYTELL ELECTRICAL CO. LIMITED\",\"email\":\"info@raytell.co.uk\",\"address\":\"9, Hampden Way, Southgate, London, N14 5DJ\",\"mobile\":\"02083 611113\",\"user\":{\"display_name\":\"Les Rumens\",\"firstname\":\"Les Rumens\",\"lastname\":\"\",\"email\":\"info@raytell.co.uk\"}}}', NULL, 5),
