(22184, 'WES SOUTHERN LTD', 'c-linkoffice@wesltdsouthern.com', 'Unit 6, Capital Industrial Estate, Crabtree Manorway South, Belvedere, Kent, DA17 6BJ', '02083107666', '02083107666', '06934861', NULL, 'Structural & Architectural Steel Fabrication and Installation', 'https://www.wesltdsouthern.com/', '<p>WES Southern Ltd are a long established family owned Structural and Architectural Steel Fabrication and Installation Company based in Erith, Kent.</p><p><br></p><p>We specialise in the manufacture and installation of steel beams and steel structures to residential and commercial refurbishments in Central London and across the South East and Kent area.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>We also produce and install structural steel for new-build projects, which can include architectural steelwork such as balustrades, balconies, staircases, fire escapes, gates and security railings.</p>', 1, 4, '2023-08-19 08:02:55', '{\"21685\":{\"name\":\"WES SOUTHERN LTD\",\"email\":\"a.riley@wesltdsouthern.com\",\"address\":\"Unit 6, Capital Industrial Estate, Crabtree Manorway South, Belvedere, Kent, DA17 6BJ\",\"mobile\":\"02083 107666\",\"user\":{\"display_name\":\"Adam Riley\",\"firstname\":\"Adam Riley\",\"lastname\":\"\",\"email\":\"a.riley@wesltdsouthern.com\"}}}', NULL, 5),
