(22238, 'PRODEM RECLAMATION LTD', 'c-linkstephen.malton@btconnect.com', '38, Middlehill Road Colehill, Wimborne, Dorset, England, BH21 2SE', '01202 511151', '07973658947', '10649373', NULL, 'Creating a new world', 'www.pro-dem.co.uk', '<p>A reclamation and asbestos removal company founded in 1993. Trading for over 30 years we have the experience to undertake any project in our sector.</p><p>Stephen Malton the director has worked his way up through the ranks from a demolition labourer to starting and running his own company. Experience gained in real world times. We use the latest technology to make the demolition and asbestos work place a safer and more efficient world to work in. Staff are qualified in accordance with the demolition industry (CCDO CITB) and asbestos removal works UKASL.</p><p>Were a small family run business that can keep up to date with the latest technology and with a hands on approach that often gets lost in bigger companies.</p><p>We are the current UK Demolition Champions as seen on tv having competed against companies from all over the UK and Ireland.</p><p>The company has been passed down from father to son so many years of experience have helped this company grow and with clients knowing they have employed a skilled and safe working company.</p>', 1, 4, '2023-08-25 10:28:54', '{\"18383\":{\"name\":\"PRODEM RECLAMATION LTD\",\"email\":\"stephen.malton@btconnect.com\",\"address\":\"38, Middlehill Road Colehill, Wimborne, Dorset, England, BH21 2SE\",\"mobile\":\"07973658947\",\"user\":{\"display_name\":\"Stephen Malton\",\"firstname\":\"Stephen Malton\",\"lastname\":\"\",\"email\":\"stephen.malton@btconnect.com\"}}}', NULL, 5),
