(4450, 21698, 1, 3, 'Sir yes sir'),
(4451, 21762, 1, 3, 'Confirm KPM worked successfully on this project and where a valuable contributor to the team.'),
(4452, 22069, 1, 3, 'Professionally done, kept in contact throughout the process, will be using DTE again on the next project'),
(4453, 22164, 1, 3, 'CPL are better than Space'),
(4454, 21999, 1, 3, 'Hailsham structures carried out the works described above  in an accurate and efficient manner to meet programme requirements. '),
(4455, 22167, 1, 3, 'Very user friendly, jumped on a tight programme and delivered as always.  Highly recommend.'),
(4456, 22302, 1, 3, 'test was passed'),
(4457, 22351, 1, 3, 'BBatch was our main contractor for the fit out of our new ‘Studio’ flagship store in the White City shopping centre in London.\n\nIt was a very large and challenging project and the support we received from Batch was outstanding. \n\nThe fit out was extensive in terms of cost, scope, complexity and duration and required Batch to manage every detail extremely closely – which they did. The service I received from Tristan and the team can only be described as exceptional. Not only did Batch carry out the works for us, they also participated actively in the design and planning part of the project – using their extensive expertise to liaise with our design agency and others to ensure that by the time we started on site we had everything we needed to hit our timelines and design objectives.  \n\nCommunications throughout were excellent, including any issues, risks and cost variations. Site management was extremely competent and professional too.   \n\nI would have absolutely no hesitation in recommending BBatch to anyone considering any type of shop-fit project, from small to very large. \n\nLink for info below  \n\nhttps://retail-focus.co.uk/ee-unveils-innovative-new-studio-store-in-westfield-london-inviting-visitors-to-relax-reconnect-and-experience-the-future-of-retail/\n\n\n'),
(4458, 22297, 1, 3, 'Arthrex integration team worked tirelessly to complete this big project over the course of a weekend. Communication was excellent throughout as was the standard of the work. Any snags were attended to in good time.'),
(4459, 22380, 1, 3, 'Exceptionally well designed and built kitchens. Kate feather did a great job and would def recommend them without hesitation '),
(4460, 22399, 1, 3, ''),
(4461, 22416, 1, 3, ''),
(4462, 22421, 1, 3, 'WPL installed Lourves to a new roof top plant room working from scaffolding built on both elevations of the building to access the upper and lower section of building.\nas a business they were good to work with and provided a good quality installation. '),
(4463, 22422, 1, 3, 'Carried out all the required work to a very satisfactory standard and have used them again since this contract and will do in the future '),
(4464, 22465, 1, 3, ''),
(4465, 22471, 1, 3, ''),
(4466, 22482, 1, 3, ''),
(4467, 22454, 1, 3, 'All works completed on time and on budget. We have worked with Sanson for a number of years now and they carry out all of our flooring works to a very high standard.'),
(4468, 22578, 1, 3, 'Jamie\'s Communication and work onsite thus far has been fantastic and look forward to continuing to work with Snag Doctor Hertforshire.\n'),
(4469, 21433, 1, 3, ''),
(4470, 22575, 1, 3, 'We have worked with Gallico on a number of projects now working closely with them on design and delivery on fire alarm systems and AOV packages. We have a number of projects already in design stage with Gallico that we will be delivering across 2024/25.'),
(4471, 22640, 1, 3, '');
