(27, 1525, 'John Leo', '', '10,000,000.00', 'Lakehouse ', 'John.Leo@lakehouse.co.uk', '2019-02-28', 'production/prequalification/insurances/766/', 'We have continuously met targets and contractual obligations over a number of years on 7 year TPC framework contract. We have helped our main client met suite of KPIs.\n\nPro Testimonial:\n\nAs stated, they have been one of our prime sub-contractors on th', 'pending', NULL, '2023-09-14 06:05:40', NULL),
(28, 1519, 'Peter Butler', '', '?40,000', 'HIS Uk ', 'peter@hisuk.co.uk, info@hisuk.co.uk', '2017-11-23', 'production/prequalification/insurances/377/', 'Rolling contract installing storage heaters for a government grant scheme, helped the company achieve PAS2030 status. The contract is based UK wide and to date we have carried out assignments in England, Wales and Scotland. This work involves installing n', 'pending', NULL, '2023-09-14 06:05:40', NULL),
