(307, 21338, 'Unit 2 Pentland Industrial Estate', 'H&H Construction (Scotland) Ltd', '30,000', 'Martin Jenkins', 'martin@hhconstruction.net', '2023-03-27', NULL, 'The scope of the works was to build a line of various offices spaces with different functionalities for the end user. These offices are located within a warehouse environment for a whisky wholesale company. As a sub-contractor we were asked to build internal partitions from plan. We had refurbished 2 existing bathrooms and created staff welfare points by installing kitchen units and sinks. The specification had been to a minimum due to the company only wanting to lease the warehouse for a 10 year period before moving on. We delivered all that was specified to scope and budget.', 'pending', NULL, '2023-09-14 06:05:40', NULL),
