(325, 21404, 'Mama Yo', 'Press Up Hospitality Group', '667784.49', 'BEN BARCLAY', 'ben@pressup.ie', '2023-02-10', NULL, 'See attached. Pure Fitout have completed the fitout for Mama Yo - a brand new Chinese restaurant in Dublin 2 - situated on Camden Street in Dublin City Centre. Opened on Valentine’s Day 2022, Mama Yo is another addition to Press Up Group’s rapidly expanding portfolio and serves contemporary Chinese food and cocktails in a beautifully designed, ambient space.  Features of the stunning interior layout include red leather and botanical print upholstery, Chinese-themed artwork, stylish lantern lighting, contemporary bar area and display and olive trees throughout the dining area.  The project consisted of:  • Compete fitout of previously empty unit. • Bespoke joinery and metalwork including bar area, service stations and doors. • Bespoke furniture.', 'pending', NULL, '2023-09-14 06:05:40', NULL),
