(388, 22351, 'Retail Reimagined ', 'EE Ltd ', '1,600,000.00', 'Dan Watson ', 'dan.watson@ee.co.uk', '2023-06-16', NULL, 'New retail store build ', 'approved', 'BBatch was our main contractor for the fit out of our new ‘Studio’ flagship store in the White City shopping centre in London.\n\nIt was a very large and challenging project and the support we received from Batch was outstanding. \n\nThe fit out was extensive in terms of cost, scope, complexity and duration and required Batch to manage every detail extremely closely – which they did. The service I received from Tristan and the team can only be described as exceptional. Not only did Batch carry out the works for us, they also participated actively in the design and planning part of the project – using their extensive expertise to liaise with our design agency and others to ensure that by the time we started on site we had everything we needed to hit our timelines and design objectives.  \n\nCommunications throughout were excellent, including any issues, risks and cost variations. Site management was extremely competent and professional too.   \n\nI would have absolutely no hesitation in recommending BBatch to anyone considering any type of shop-fit project, from small to very large. \n\nLink for info below  \n\nhttps://retail-focus.co.uk/ee-unveils-innovative-new-studio-store-in-westfield-london-inviting-visitors-to-relax-reconnect-and-experience-the-future-of-retail/\n\n\n', '2023-10-04 11:41:17', '2023-10-04 13:36:46'),
